ní schůzek</li>","<li>Supporting presentations</li>":"<li>Podpora prezentací</li>","<li>Maintaining stakeholder engagement</li>":"<li>Udržování zapojení zainteresovaných stran</li>","<li>Assisting with commercial follow-up</li>":"<li>Pomoc s následnou obchodní komunikací</li>","<li>Helping move the opportunity toward a decision</li>":"<li>Pomoc s posunem příležitosti k rozhodnutí</li>","<h3>Strategic Partner</h3>":"<h3>Strategický partner</h3>","<p class=\"pl-desc\">For established partners who generate recurring opportunities, provide strategic market access or assume meaningful commercial and customer responsibilities.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-desc\">Pro zavedené partnery, kteří generují opakované příležitosti, poskytují strategický přístup na trh nebo přebírají významnou obchodní a zákaznickou odpovědnost.</p>","<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Potential activities</span>":"<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Možné činnosti</span>","<li>Recurring pipeline generation</li>":"<li>Opakované generování pipeline</li>","<li>Regional or industry market development</li>":"<li>Rozvoj trhu v regionu nebo odvětví</li>","<li>Active sales ownership</li>":"<li>Aktivní odpovědnost za prodej</li>","<li>Account development</li>":"<li>Rozvoj zákaznických účtů</li>","<li>Implementation coordination</li>":"<li>Koordinace implementace</li>","<li>Initial customer support</li>":"<li>Počáteční zákaznická podpora</li>","<li>Joint go-to-market activities</li>":"<li>Společné go-to-market aktivity</li>","<p class=\"pl-note\">Strategic-partner terms are agreed individually and may depend on volume, territory, responsibilities, support model and commercial commitment.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-note\">Podmínky pro strategické partnery se sjednávají individuálně a mohou záviset na objemu, teritoriu, odpovědnostech, modelu podpory a obchodním závazku.</p>","<h3 class=\"pl-lbl\" style=\"margin-top:40px;font-size:11.5px\">Partner contribution and typical commission</h3>":"<h3 class=\"pl-lbl\" style=\"margin-top:40px;font-size:11.5px\">Přínos partnera a typická provize</h3>","<th scope=\"col\">Partner contribution</th>":"<th scope=\"col\">Přínos partnera</th>","<th scope=\"col\">Typical commission</th>":"<th scope=\"col\">Typická provize</th>","<td>Qualified referral or introduction</td>":"<td>Kvalifikované doporučení nebo představení</td>","<td>Meeting arrangement and active sales support</td>":"<td>Sjednání schůzky a aktivní obchodní podpora</td>","<td>Full presentation and commercial close</td>":"<td>Kompletní prezentace a uzavření obchodu</td>","<td>Authorized reseller with sales and initial support</td>":"<td>Autorizovaný prodejce s prodejem a počáteční podporou</td>","<p class=\"pl-small\">Final commission terms depend on the partner's role, transaction size, discount level, customer responsibilities, territory and ongoing support obligations.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-small\">Konečné podmínky provize závisí na roli partnera, velikosti transakce, úrovni slevy, odpovědnostech vůči zákazníkovi, teritoriu a průběžných povinnostech podpory.</p>","<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Example transaction</span>":"<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Příklad transakce</span>","<span>Agent contract value</span>":"<span>Hodnota smlouvy na agenta</span>","<span>Referral Partner commission at 10%</span>":"<span>Provize referenčního partnera ve výši 10 %</span>","<span>Revenue retained by ColleagueAI before delivery costs and other expenses</span>":"<span>Příjem, který si ColleagueAI ponechává před náklady na dodání a dalšími výdaji</span>","<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Clear and transparent partner terms</h3>":"<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Jasné a transparentní partnerské podmínky</h3>","<li>Commission is normally calculated from eligible net revenue.</li>":"<li>Provize se obvykle počítá ze způsobilého čistého příjmu.</li>","<li>Commission becomes payable only after the customer's payment has been received.</li>":"<li>Provize se stává splatnou až po přijetí platby od zákazníka.</li>","<li>Taxes, refunds, credits, chargebacks and excluded pass-through costs may be deducted from the commission base.</li>":"<li>Od základu pro výpočet provize mohou být odečteny daně, vratky, dobropisy, zpětné platby (chargebacky) a vyloučené přeúčtované náklady.</li>","<li>Every opportunity must be registered and accepted before commission protection begins.</li>":"<li>Každá příležitost musí být zaregistrována a přijata dříve, než začne ochrana provize.</li>","<li>Referral protection applies for a defined contractual period.</li>":"<li>Ochrana doporučení platí po vymezené smluvní období.</li>","<li>Existing customers and previously active opportunities may be excluded.</li>":"<li>Stávající zákazníci a dříve aktivní příležitosti mohou být vyloučeni.</li>","<li>The agreement must define responsibility where multiple partners claim the same opportunity.</li>":"<li>Smlouva musí vymezit odpovědnost v případě, že si stejnou příležitost nárokuje více partnerů.</li>","<li>Renewal and expansion commissions apply only when explicitly included in the partner agreement.</li>":"<li>Provize za obnovení a rozšíření se uplatňují pouze tehdy, jsou-li výslovně zahrnuty v partnerské smlouvě.</li>","<li>Strategic or reseller relationships may include additional customer-support and service obligations.</li>":"<li>Strategické nebo prodejní vztahy mohou zahrnovat další povinnosti v oblasti zákaznické podpory a služeb.</li>","<li>Regional, industry or account exclusivity must be documented in writing.</li>":"<li>Regionální, oborová nebo zákaznická exkluzivita musí být zdokumentována písemně.</li>","<li>ColleagueAI may reject opportunities that do not meet qualification, compliance or commercial requirements.</li>":"<li>ColleagueAI může odmítnout příležitosti, které nesplňují kvalifikační, compliance nebo obchodní požadavky.</li>","<p class=\"pl-disc\">Commission percentages shown on this page are indicative program terms and do not create an entitlement to payment. All partnerships are subject to approval and a signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-disc\">Procenta provizí uvedená na této stránce jsou orientační podmínky programu a nezakládají nárok na platbu. Veškerá partnerství podléhají schválení a podepsané partnerské smlouvě.</p>","<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Apply to become a partner</h3>":"<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Přihlaste se a staňte se partnerem</h3>","<p class=\"pl-formlead\">Tell us about your business and how you would work with ColleagueAI. Include the details below in your email. Applications are reviewed individually; approval and commission eligibility remain subject to a signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-formlead\">Řekněte nám o svém podnikání a o tom, jak byste chtěli spolupracovat s ColleagueAI. Do svého e-mailu uveďte níže uvedené údaje. Přihlášky posuzujeme individuálně; schválení a nárok na provizi zůstávají podmíněny podepsanou partnerskou smlouvou.</p>","<li>Your company, website and country</li>":"<li>Vaše společnost, webové stránky a země</li>","<li>The partner level you are interested in</li>":"<li>Úroveň partnerství, o kterou máte zájem</li>","<li>The industries and customer segments you work with</li>":"<li>Odvětví a zákaznické segmenty, s nimiž pracujete</li>","<li>Your typical customer reach</li>":"<li>Váš typický zákaznický dosah</li>","<li>Any existing technology partnerships</li>":"<li>Případná stávající technologická partnerství</li>","<span class=\"eyebrow\">Questions</span>":"<span class=\"eyebrow\">Otázky</span>","<h2 class=\"sec-h\">Common questions, direct answers.</h2>":"<h2 class=\"sec-h\">Časté otázky, přímé odpovědi.</h2>","<p>Attribution is set up when your application is approved. The method, the attribution window and how sales are matched to you are recorded in your signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p>Atribuce se nastavuje při schválení vaší přihlášky. Metoda, atribuční okno a způsob, jakým se vám prodeje přiřazují, jsou zaznamenány ve vaší podepsané partnerské smlouvě.</p>","<p>Commission is held for a review period after each sale, then approved and paid on the schedule set out in your partner agreement. Payment details are confirmed during onboarding.</p>":"<p>Provize je po každém prodeji zadržena po dobu kontrolního období, poté je schválena a vyplacena podle harmonogramu stanoveného ve vaší partnerské smlouvě. Platební údaje se potvrzují během onboardingu.</p>","<p>Approved partners may refer clients or licence agents themselves and deploy them under their own service agreement. Which routes apply to you is confirmed at approval.</p>":"<p>Schválení partneři mohou doporučovat klienty nebo si sami licencovat agenty a nasazovat je v rámci vlastní smlouvy o poskytování služeb. Které možnosti se na vás vztahují, se potvrzuje při schválení.</p>","<p>Attribution follows the method agreed in your partner agreement. Sales completed before your partnership was approved cannot be attributed retroactively.</p>":"<p>Atribuce se řídí metodou dohodnutou ve vaší partnerské smlouvě. Prodeje uskutečněné před schválením vašeho partnerství nelze přiřadit zpětně.</p>","<p>Rates vary by partner level and are indicative until confirmed. Your applicable rate, and any limits, are fixed in your signed partner agreement and recorded against each sale.</p>":"<p>Sazby se liší podle úrovně partnerství a jsou orientační, dokud nejsou potvrzeny. Vaše platná sazba a případné limity jsou stanoveny ve vaší podepsané partnerské smlouvě a zaznamenány u každého prodeje.</p>","<p>Contact us at hello@colleagueai.ai and we will reissue it. Attribution details are confirmed during onboarding, so your link and commission terms stay tied to your signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p>Kontaktujte nás na hello@colleagueai.ai a znovu vám jej vystavíme. Podrobnosti o atribuci se potvrzují během onboardingu, takže váš odkaz a podmínky provize zůstávají vázány na vaši podepsanou partnerskou smlouvu.</p>","<p>Yes. Participation requires an approved application and a signed partner agreement. The rate and terms in force at the time of each sale are recorded against it. Request a copy at hello@colleagueai.ai.</p>":"<p>Ano. Účast vyžaduje schválenou přihlášku a podepsanou partnerskou smlouvu. Sazba a podmínky platné v době každého prodeje jsou u něj zaznamenány. O kopii požádejte na hello@colleagueai.ai.</p>","<h2>Ready to bring enterprise AI to <em>your</em> clients?</h2>":"<h2>Připraveni přinést podnikovou AI <em>vašim</em> klientům?</h2>","<span class=\"logo-text\" style=\"font-size:18px\">colleague<span class=\"ai\">ai</span>":"<span class=\"logo-text\" style=\"font-size:18px\">colleague<span class=\"ai\">ai</span>","<span class=\"foot-note\">// Partner Pilot Programme · CAI Score™ · Updated June 2026</span>":"<span class=\"foot-note\">// Pilotní partnerský program · CAI Score™ · Aktualizováno June 2026</span>","<h2>What buyers and AI assistants ask about Colleague AI.</h2>":"<h2>Na co se kupující a AI asistenti ptají ohledně Colleague AI.</h2>","<p>Direct answers on the CAI Score, deployment, EU AI Act alignment, and how the trust layer differs from an agent management platform.</p>":"<p>Přímé odpovědi ohledně CAI Score, nasazení, souladu s EU AI Act a toho, jak se vrstva důvěry liší od platformy pro správu agentů.</p>","<p>The Portfolio package applies where several specialized agents operate together across functions and systems. Scope typically adds centralized reporting, advanced security and access requirements, shared governance controls, multi-stage approvals and wider organizational rollout. These solutions are designed and priced individually.</p>":"<p>Balíček Portfolio se uplatní tam, kde několik specializovaných agentů funguje společně napříč funkcemi a systémy. Rozsah obvykle přidává centralizované reportování, pokročilé požadavky na bezpečnost a přístup, sdílené governance kontroly, vícestupňová schvalování a širší organizační nasazení. Tato řešení se navrhují a oceňují individuálně.</p>","The interactive demo has been withdrawn, so this website sends no messages to an AI provider.":"Interaktivní demo bylo staženo, takže tento web neodesílá žádné zprávy poskytovateli AI.","We use privacy-friendly, <strong>cookieless</strong> analytics, no personal tracking or ad cookies. See our ":"Používáme <strong>bezcookie</strong> analytiku šetrnou k soukromí, žádné osobní sledování ani reklamní cookies. Viz naše "},"de":{"<p class=\"note\">Last updated: 13 June 2026 · Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) · <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>":"<p class=\"note\">Zuletzt aktualisiert: 13 June 2026 · Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) · <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>","<h2>1. Acceptance</h2>":"<h2>1. Annahme</h2>","<p>By using colleagueai.ai or purchasing any product, subscription, licence or AI agent, you agree to these Terms.</p>":"<p>Durch die Nutzung von colleagueai.ai oder den Erwerb eines Produkts, eines Abonnements, einer Lizenz oder eines KI-Agenten stimmen Sie diesen Bedingungen zu.</p>","<h2>2. Accounts</h2>":"<h2>2. Konten</h2>","<p>You are responsible for accurate details and for safeguarding your credentials and MFA.</p>":"<p>Sie sind für die Richtigkeit Ihrer Angaben sowie für den Schutz Ihrer Zugangsdaten und MFA verantwortlich.</p>","<h2>3. Products & licences</h2>":"<h2>3. Produkte & Lizenzen</h2>","<li>Subscriptions renew until cancelled.</li>":"<li>Abonnements verlängern sich, bis sie gekündigt werden.</li>","<li>One-time licences follow the <a href=\"/license\">Licence</a>.</li>":"<li>Einmallizenzen unterliegen der <a href=\"/license\">Lizenz</a>.</li>","<li>AI agents are licensed per tenant, deployed in your environment.</li>":"<li>KI-Agenten werden pro Tenant lizenziert und in Ihrer Umgebung bereitgestellt.</li>","<h2>4. Payment</h2>":"<h2>4. Zahlung</h2>","<p>Payments are processed by Stripe in your selected currency, including applicable taxes (e.g. VAT) by billing region.</p>":"<p>Zahlungen werden von Stripe in der von Ihnen gewählten Währung verarbeitet, einschließlich der je nach Abrechnungsregion anfallenden Steuern (z. B. USt.).</p>","<h2>5. Acceptable use</h2>":"<h2>5. Zulässige Nutzung</h2>","<p>No security breach attempts, reverse-engineering, resale/redistribution, or unlawful use.</p>":"<p>Keine Versuche von Sicherheitsverletzungen, kein Reverse-Engineering, kein Weiterverkauf/keine Weiterverbreitung und keine rechtswidrige Nutzung.</p>","<h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>":"<h2>6. Geistiges Eigentum</h2>","<p>The CAI Score framework, platform and agent blueprints are proprietary to Colleague AI.</p>":"<p>Das CAI-Score-Framework, die Plattform und die Agent-Blueprints sind ausschließliches Eigentum von Colleague AI.</p>","<h2>7. Disclaimers & liability</h2>":"<h2>7. Haftungsausschlüsse & Haftung</h2>","<p>Provided \"as is\"; implied warranties excluded and liability limited to amounts paid in the prior 12 months, to the extent permitted by law. ROI/readiness outputs are indicative, not advice.</p>":"<p>Bereitstellung „wie besehen“; stillschweigende Gewährleistungen sind ausgeschlossen und die Haftung ist auf die in den vorangegangenen 12 Monaten gezahlten Beträge begrenzt, soweit gesetzlich zulässig. ROI-/Readiness-Ergebnisse sind indikativ und stellen keine Beratung dar.</p>","<h2>8. Termination</h2>":"<h2>8. Kündigung</h2>","<p>Either party may terminate per the order; licence rights then cease.</p>":"<p>Jede Partei kann gemäß der Bestellung kündigen; die Lizenzrechte enden sodann.</p>","<h2>9. Governing law</h2>":"<h2>9. Anwendbares Recht</h2>","<p>Governed by the laws of Czechia and the EU; courts of Praha, subject to mandatory consumer law.</p>":"<p>Es gelten die Gesetze Tschechiens und der EU; Gerichtsstand ist Praha, vorbehaltlich zwingenden Verbraucherrechts.</p>","<h2>10. Contact</h2>":"<h2>10. Kontakt</h2>","<p><a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>":"<p><a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>","<h2>1. Who we are</h2>":"<h2>1. Wer wir sind</h2>","<p>Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) is the data controller. Contact <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a>.</p>":"<p>Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) ist der Verantwortliche. Kontakt <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a>.</p>","<h2>2. Data we collect</h2>":"<h2>2. Daten, die wir erheben</h2>","<li>Account/contact data (forms).</li>":"<li>Konto-/Kontaktdaten (Formulare).</li>","<li>Transaction data (cards handled by Stripe; we don't store card numbers).</li>":"<li>Transaktionsdaten (Karten werden von Stripe verarbeitet; wir speichern keine Kartennummern).</li>","<li>Post-purchase records: buyer email, purchased agent slugs and the Stripe checkout session id (stored to grant your download entitlement), plus any partner/referral code.</li>":"<li>Datensätze nach dem Kauf: E-Mail-Adresse des Käufers, erworbene Agent-Slugs und die Stripe-Checkout-Session-ID (gespeichert, um Ihre Download-Berechtigung zu gewähren), sowie ein etwaiger Partner-/Empfehlungscode.</li>","<li>Cookieless analytics (Plausible and Vercel Web Analytics / Speed Insights) and error monitoring (Sentry).</li>":"<li>Cookielose Analyse (Plausible und Vercel Web Analytics / Speed Insights) und Fehlerüberwachung (Sentry).</li>","<li>Communications and marketing preferences.</li>":"<li>Kommunikations- und Marketingpräferenzen.</li>","<h2>3. Purposes & legal bases</h2>":"<h2>3. Zwecke & Rechtsgrundlagen</h2>","<th>Purpose</th>":"<th>Zweck</th>","<th>Basis</th>":"<th>Grundlage</th>","<td>Operate the services</td>":"<td>Betrieb der Dienste</td>","<td>Contract</td>":"<td>Vertrag</td>","<td>Payments</td>":"<td>Zahlungen</td>","<td>Contract / legal obligation</td>":"<td>Vertrag / rechtliche Verpflichtung</td>","<td>Security & logging</td>":"<td>Sicherheit & Protokollierung</td>","<td>Legitimate interests</td>":"<td>Berechtigte Interessen</td>","<td>Analytics</td>":"<td>Analyse</td>","<td>Legitimate interests / consent</td>":"<td>Berechtigte Interessen / Einwilligung</td>","<td>Marketing</td>":"<td>Marketing</td>","<td>Consent (opt-in)</td>":"<td>Einwilligung (Opt-in)</td>","<h2>4. Subprocessors</h2>":"<h2>4. Unterauftragsverarbeiter</h2>","<p>Vercel (hosting &amp; web analytics), Stripe (payments), Upstash (entitlement &amp; partner-code storage), Cloudflare R2 (deliverable file storage), Plausible (cookieless analytics), Sentry (error monitoring), Google Fonts (web fonts). Full list on request and in the <a href=\"/trust\">Trust Center</a>.</p>":"<p>Vercel (Hosting &amp; Web-Analyse), Stripe (Zahlungen), Upstash (Speicherung von Berechtigungen &amp; Partnercodes), Cloudflare R2 (Speicherung von Lieferdateien), Plausible (cookielose Analyse), Sentry (Fehlerüberwachung), Google Fonts (Web-Schriftarten). Vollständige Liste auf Anfrage und im <a href=\"/trust\">Trust Center</a>.</p>","<h2>5. Transfers</h2>":"<h2>5. Übermittlungen</h2>","<p>Outside the EEA we rely on adequacy or Standard Contractual Clauses.</p>":"<p>Außerhalb des EWR stützen wir uns auf einen Angemessenheitsbeschluss oder Standardvertragsklauseln.</p>","<h2>6. Retention</h2>":"<h2>6. Speicherdauer</h2>","<p>Kept only as long as necessary, then deleted or anonymised.</p>":"<p>Aufbewahrung nur so lange wie erforderlich, danach Löschung oder Anonymisierung.</p>","<h2>7. Your rights</h2>":"<h2>7. Ihre Rechte</h2>","<p>Access, rectify, erase, restrict, port, object, and withdraw consent. You may complain to your supervisory authority (in Czechia, the ÚOOÚ).</p>":"<p>Auskunft, Berichtigung, Löschung, Einschränkung, Datenübertragbarkeit, Widerspruch und Widerruf der Einwilligung. Sie können sich bei Ihrer Aufsichtsbehörde beschweren (in Tschechien beim ÚOOÚ).</p>","<h2>8. Cookies</h2>":"<h2>8. Cookies</h2>","<p>Analytics is cookieless; non-essential tracking loads only with consent.</p>":"<p>Die Analyse erfolgt cookielos; nicht notwendiges Tracking wird nur mit Einwilligung geladen.</p>","<h2>9. Contact</h2>":"<h2>9. Kontakt</h2>","<p><a href=\"/imprint\">Legal notice / Company details</a></p>":"<p><a href=\"/imprint\">Impressum / Unternehmensangaben</a></p>","<h3>Sales Partner</h3>":"<h3>Vertriebspartner</h3>","<p class=\"pl-desc\">For partners who actively qualify opportunities and participate in progressing the commercial relationship.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-desc\">Für Partner, die aktiv Opportunities qualifizieren und daran mitwirken, die Geschäftsbeziehung voranzutreiben.</p>","<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Typical activities</span>":"<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Typische Tätigkeiten</span>","<li>Qualifying customer needs</li>":"<li>Qualifizierung des Kundenbedarfs</li>","<li>Arranging meetings</li>":"<li>Vereinbarung von Terminen</li>","<li>Supporting presentations</li>":"<li>Unterstützung bei Präsentationen</li>","<li>Maintaining stakeholder engagement</li>":"<li>Pflege des Stakeholder-Engagements</li>","<li>Assisting with commercial follow-up</li>":"<li>Unterstützung bei der kommerziellen Nachverfolgung</li>","<li>Helping move the opportunity toward a decision</li>":"<li>Unterstützung dabei, die Opportunity einer Entscheidung näherzubringen</li>","<h3>Strategic Partner</h3>":"<h3>Strategischer Partner</h3>","<p class=\"pl-desc\">For established partners who generate recurring opportunities, provide strategic market access or assume meaningful commercial and customer responsibilities.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-desc\">Für etablierte Partner, die wiederkehrende Opportunities generieren, strategischen Marktzugang bieten oder maßgebliche kommerzielle und kundenbezogene Verantwortung übernehmen.</p>","<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Potential activities</span>":"<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Mögliche Tätigkeiten</span>","<li>Recurring pipeline generation</li>":"<li>Generierung einer wiederkehrenden Pipeline</li>","<li>Regional or industry market development</li>":"<li>Regionale oder branchenbezogene Marktentwicklung</li>","<li>Active sales ownership</li>":"<li>Aktive Vertriebsverantwortung</li>","<li>Account development</li>":"<li>Account-Entwicklung</li>","<li>Implementation coordination</li>":"<li>Koordination der Implementierung</li>","<li>Initial customer support</li>":"<li>Erstbetreuung der Kunden</li>","<li>Joint go-to-market activities</li>":"<li>Gemeinsame Go-to-Market-Aktivitäten</li>","<p class=\"pl-note\">Strategic-partner terms are agreed individually and may depend on volume, territory, responsibilities, support model and commercial commitment.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-note\">Die Konditionen für strategische Partner werden individuell vereinbart und können von Volumen, Gebiet, Verantwortlichkeiten, Supportmodell und kommerziellem Engagement abhängen.</p>","<h3 class=\"pl-lbl\" style=\"margin-top:40px;font-size:11.5px\">Partner contribution and typical commission</h3>":"<h3 class=\"pl-lbl\" style=\"margin-top:40px;font-size:11.5px\">Partnerbeitrag und typische Provision</h3>","<th scope=\"col\">Partner contribution</th>":"<th scope=\"col\">Partnerbeitrag</th>","<th scope=\"col\">Typical commission</th>":"<th scope=\"col\">Typische Provision</th>","<td>Qualified referral or introduction</td>":"<td>Qualifizierte Empfehlung oder Vermittlung</td>","<td>Meeting arrangement and active sales support</td>":"<td>Terminvereinbarung und aktive Vertriebsunterstützung</td>","<td>Full presentation and commercial close</td>":"<td>Vollständige Präsentation und kommerzieller Abschluss</td>","<td>Authorized reseller with sales and initial support</td>":"<td>Autorisierter Reseller mit Vertrieb und Erstsupport</td>","<p class=\"pl-small\">Final commission terms depend on the partner's role, transaction size, discount level, customer responsibilities, territory and ongoing support obligations.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-small\">Die endgültigen Provisionskonditionen hängen von der Rolle des Partners, der Transaktionsgröße, der Rabatthöhe, den Kundenverantwortlichkeiten, dem Gebiet und den laufenden Supportverpflichtungen ab.</p>","<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Example transaction</span>":"<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Beispieltransaktion</span>","<span>Agent contract value</span>":"<span>Vertragswert des Agenten</span>","<span>Referral Partner commission at 10%</span>":"<span>Provision des Empfehlungspartners in Höhe von 10 %</span>","<span>Revenue retained by ColleagueAI before delivery costs and other expenses</span>":"<span>Von ColleagueAI einbehaltener Umsatz vor Lieferkosten und sonstigen Aufwendungen</span>","<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Clear and transparent partner terms</h3>":"<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Klare und transparente Partnerkonditionen</h3>","<li>Commission is normally calculated from eligible net revenue.</li>":"<li>Die Provision wird in der Regel auf Basis des anrechenbaren Nettoumsatzes berechnet.</li>","<li>Commission becomes payable only after the customer's payment has been received.</li>":"<li>Die Provision wird erst fällig, nachdem die Zahlung des Kunden eingegangen ist.</li>","<li>Taxes, refunds, credits, chargebacks and excluded pass-through costs may be deducted from the commission base.</li>":"<li>Steuern, Rückerstattungen, Gutschriften, Rückbuchungen und ausgeschlossene durchlaufende Kosten können von der Provisionsbasis abgezogen werden.</li>","<li>Every opportunity must be registered and accepted before commission protection begins.</li>":"<li>Jede Opportunity muss registriert und akzeptiert werden, bevor der Provisionsschutz beginnt.</li>","<li>Referral protection applies for a defined contractual period.</li>":"<li>Der Empfehlungsschutz gilt für einen definierten Vertragszeitraum.</li>","<li>Existing customers and previously active opportunities may be excluded.</li>":"<li>Bestandskunden und zuvor aktive Opportunities können ausgeschlossen werden.</li>","<li>The agreement must define responsibility where multiple partners claim the same opportunity.</li>":"<li>Die Vereinbarung muss die Verantwortlichkeit festlegen, wenn mehrere Partner dieselbe Opportunity beanspruchen.</li>","<li>Renewal and expansion commissions apply only when explicitly included in the partner agreement.</li>":"<li>Provisionen für Verlängerungen und Erweiterungen gelten nur, wenn sie ausdrücklich in der Partnervereinbarung enthalten sind.</li>","<li>Strategic or reseller relationships may include additional customer-support and service obligations.</li>":"<li>Strategische oder Reseller-Beziehungen können zusätzliche Kundensupport- und Serviceverpflichtungen umfassen.</li>","<li>Regional, industry or account exclusivity must be documented in writing.</li>":"<li>Regionale, branchenbezogene oder kundenbezogene Exklusivität muss schriftlich dokumentiert werden.</li>","<li>ColleagueAI may reject opportunities that do not meet qualification, compliance or commercial requirements.</li>":"<li>ColleagueAI kann Opportunities ablehnen, die die Qualifizierungs-, Compliance- oder kommerziellen Anforderungen nicht erfüllen.</li>","<p class=\"pl-disc\">Commission percentages shown on this page are indicative program terms and do not create an entitlement to payment. All partnerships are subject to approval and a signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-disc\">Die auf dieser Seite angegebenen Provisionssätze sind indikative Programmkonditionen und begründen keinen Zahlungsanspruch. Alle Partnerschaften stehen unter dem Vorbehalt einer Genehmigung und einer unterzeichneten Partnervereinbarung.</p>","<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Apply to become a partner</h3>":"<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Bewerben Sie sich als Partner</h3>","<p class=\"pl-formlead\">Tell us about your business and how you would work with ColleagueAI. Include the details below in your email. Applications are reviewed individually; approval and commission eligibility remain subject to a signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-formlead\">Erzählen Sie uns von Ihrem Unternehmen und wie Sie mit ColleagueAI zusammenarbeiten würden. Fügen Sie die unten stehenden Angaben in Ihre E-Mail ein. Bewerbungen werden individuell geprüft; Genehmigung und Provisionsberechtigung bleiben einer unterzeichneten Partnervereinbarung vorbehalten.</p>","<li>Your company, website and country</li>":"<li>Ihr Unternehmen, Ihre Website und Ihr Land</li>","<li>The partner level you are interested in</li>":"<li>Die Partnerstufe, an der Sie interessiert sind</li>","<li>The industries and customer segments you work with</li>":"<li>Die Branchen und Kundensegmente, mit denen Sie arbeiten</li>","<li>Your typical customer reach</li>":"<li>Ihre typische Kundenreichweite</li>","<li>Any existing technology partnerships</li>":"<li>Etwaige bestehende Technologiepartnerschaften</li>","<span class=\"eyebrow\">Questions</span>":"<span class=\"eyebrow\">Fragen</span>","<h2 class=\"sec-h\">Common questions, direct answers.</h2>":"<h2 class=\"sec-h\">Häufige Fragen, direkte Antworten.</h2>","<p>Attribution is set up when your application is approved. The method, the attribution window and how sales are matched to you are recorded in your signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p>Die Zuordnung wird eingerichtet, sobald Ihre Bewerbung genehmigt ist. Die Methode, das Zuordnungsfenster und die Art und Weise, wie Verkäufe Ihnen zugeordnet werden, sind in Ihrer unterzeichneten Partnervereinbarung festgehalten.</p>","<p>Commission is held for a review period after each sale, then approved and paid on the schedule set out in your partner agreement. Payment details are confirmed during onboarding.</p>":"<p>Die Provision wird nach jedem Verkauf für einen Prüfzeitraum einbehalten, anschließend genehmigt und gemäß dem in Ihrer Partnervereinbarung festgelegten Zeitplan ausgezahlt. Die Zahlungsdetails werden während des Onboardings bestätigt.</p>","<p>Approved partners may refer clients or licence agents themselves and deploy them under their own service agreement. Which routes apply to you is confirmed at approval.</p>":"<p>Genehmigte Partner können Kunden empfehlen oder Agenten selbst lizenzieren und diese im Rahmen ihrer eigenen Servicevereinbarung bereitstellen. Welche Wege für Sie gelten, wird bei der Genehmigung bestätigt.</p>","<p>Attribution follows the method agreed in your partner agreement. Sales completed before your partnership was approved cannot be attributed retroactively.</p>":"<p>Die Zuordnung erfolgt nach der in Ihrer Partnervereinbarung vereinbarten Methode. Verkäufe, die vor der Genehmigung Ihrer Partnerschaft abgeschlossen wurden, können nicht rückwirkend zugeordnet werden.</p>","<p>Rates vary by partner level and are indicative until confirmed. Your applicable rate, and any limits, are fixed in your signed partner agreement and recorded against each sale.</p>":"<p>Die Sätze variieren je nach Partnerstufe und sind bis zur Bestätigung indikativ. Ihr geltender Satz sowie etwaige Obergrenzen werden in Ihrer unterzeichneten Partnervereinbarung festgelegt und für jeden Verkauf erfasst.</p>","<p>Contact us at hello@colleagueai.ai and we will reissue it. Attribution details are confirmed during onboarding, so your link and commission terms stay tied to your signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p>Kontaktieren Sie uns unter hello@colleagueai.ai und wir stellen ihn erneut aus. Die Zuordnungsdetails werden während des Onboardings bestätigt, sodass Ihr Link und Ihre Provisionskonditionen mit Ihrer unterzeichneten Partnervereinbarung verknüpft bleiben.</p>","<p>Yes. Participation requires an approved application and a signed partner agreement. The rate and terms in force at the time of each sale are recorded against it. Request a copy at hello@colleagueai.ai.</p>":"<p>Ja. Die Teilnahme setzt eine genehmigte Bewerbung und eine unterzeichnete Partnervereinbarung voraus. Der zum Zeitpunkt jedes Verkaufs geltende Satz und die geltenden Konditionen werden dazu erfasst. Fordern Sie eine Kopie unter hello@colleagueai.ai an.</p>","<h2>Ready to bring enterprise AI to <em>your</em> clients?</h2>":"<h2>Bereit, Enterprise-KI zu <em>Ihren</em> Kunden zu bringen?</h2>","<span class=\"logo-text\" style=\"font-size:18px\">colleague<span class=\"ai\">ai</span>":"<span class=\"logo-text\" style=\"font-size:18px\">colleague<span class=\"ai\">ai</span>","<span class=\"foot-note\">// Partner Pilot Programme · CAI Score™ · Updated June 2026</span>":"<span class=\"foot-note\">// Partner-Pilotprogramm · CAI Score™ · Aktualisiert June 2026</span>","<h2>What buyers and AI assistants ask about Colleague AI.</h2>":"<h2>Was Käufer und KI-Assistenten über Colleague AI fragen.</h2>","<p>Direct answers on the CAI Score, deployment, EU AI Act alignment, and how the trust layer differs from an agent management platform.</p>":"<p>Direkte Antworten zum CAI Score, zur Bereitstellung, zur Ausrichtung am EU AI Act und dazu, wie sich der Trust-Layer von einer Agent-Management-Plattform unterscheidet.</p>","<p>The Portfolio package applies where several specialized agents operate together across functions and systems. Scope typically adds centralized reporting, advanced security and access requirements, shared governance controls, multi-stage approvals and wider organizational rollout. These solutions are designed and priced individually.</p>":"<p>Das Portfolio-Paket kommt zum Einsatz, wenn mehrere spezialisierte Agenten funktions- und systemübergreifend zusammenarbeiten. Der Umfang umfasst typischerweise zusätzlich zentralisiertes Reporting, erweiterte Sicherheits- und Zugriffsanforderungen, gemeinsame Governance-Kontrollen, mehrstufige Genehmigungen und einen breiteren organisatorischen Rollout. Diese Lösungen werden individuell konzipiert und bepreist.</p>","The interactive demo has been withdrawn, so this website sends no messages to an AI provider.":"Die interaktive Demo wurde zurückgezogen, sodass diese Website keine Nachrichten an einen KI-Anbieter sendet.","We use privacy-friendly, <strong>cookieless</strong> analytics, no personal tracking or ad cookies. See our ":"Wir nutzen datenschutzfreundliche, <strong>cookielose</strong> Analyse, kein personenbezogenes Tracking und keine Werbe-Cookies. Siehe unsere "},"fr":{"<p class=\"note\">Last updated: 13 June 2026 · Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) · <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>":"<p class=\"note\">Dernière mise à jour : 13 juin 2026 · Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) · <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>","<h2>1. Acceptance</h2>":"<h2>1. Acceptation</h2>","<p>By using colleagueai.ai or purchasing any product, subscription, licence or AI agent, you agree to these Terms.</p>":"<p>En utilisant colleagueai.ai ou en achetant un produit, un abonnement, une licence ou un agent IA, vous acceptez les présentes Conditions.</p>","<h2>2. Accounts</h2>":"<h2>2. Comptes</h2>","<p>You are responsible for accurate details and for safeguarding your credentials and MFA.</p>":"<p>Vous êtes responsable de l'exactitude des informations ainsi que de la protection de vos identifiants et de votre MFA.</p>","<h2>3. Products & licences</h2>":"<h2>3. Produits et licences</h2>","<li>Subscriptions renew until cancelled.</li>":"<li>Les abonnements se renouvellent jusqu'à leur résiliation.</li>","<li>One-time licences follow the <a href=\"/license\">Licence</a>.</li>":"<li>Les licences ponctuelles sont régies par la <a href=\"/license\">Licence</a>.</li>","<li>AI agents are licensed per tenant, deployed in your environment.</li>":"<li>Les agents IA sont concédés sous licence par tenant et déployés dans votre environnement.</li>","<h2>4. Payment</h2>":"<h2>4. Paiement</h2>","<p>Payments are processed by Stripe in your selected currency, including applicable taxes (e.g. VAT) by billing region.</p>":"<p>Les paiements sont traités par Stripe dans la devise que vous avez sélectionnée, taxes applicables comprises (p. ex. TVA) selon la région de facturation.</p>","<h2>5. Acceptable use</h2>":"<h2>5. Utilisation acceptable</h2>","<p>No security breach attempts, reverse-engineering, resale/redistribution, or unlawful use.</p>":"<p>Aucune tentative d'atteinte à la sécurité, d'ingénierie inverse, de revente/redistribution ni d'utilisation illicite.</p>","<h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>":"<h2>6. Propriété intellectuelle</h2>","<p>The CAI Score framework, platform and agent blueprints are proprietary to Colleague AI.</p>":"<p>Le cadre CAI Score, la plateforme et les plans d'agents sont la propriété exclusive de Colleague AI.</p>","<h2>7. Disclaimers & liability</h2>":"<h2>7. Avertissements et responsabilité</h2>","<p>Provided \"as is\"; implied warranties excluded and liability limited to amounts paid in the prior 12 months, to the extent permitted by law. ROI/readiness outputs are indicative, not advice.</p>":"<p>Fourni « en l'état » ; les garanties implicites sont exclues et la responsabilité est limitée aux montants payés au cours des 12 derniers mois, dans la mesure permise par la loi. Les résultats de ROI/préparation sont indicatifs et ne constituent pas un conseil.</p>","<h2>8. Termination</h2>":"<h2>8. Résiliation</h2>","<p>Either party may terminate per the order; licence rights then cease.</p>":"<p>Chaque partie peut résilier conformément à la commande ; les droits de licence prennent alors fin.</p>","<h2>9. Governing law</h2>":"<h2>9. Droit applicable</h2>","<p>Governed by the laws of Czechia and the EU; courts of Praha, subject to mandatory consumer law.</p>":"<p>Régi par le droit de la Tchéquie et de l'UE ; tribunaux de Praha, sous réserve des dispositions impératives du droit de la consommation.</p>","<h2>10. Contact</h2>":"<h2>10. Contact</h2>","<p><a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>":"<p><a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>","<h2>1. Who we are</h2>":"<h2>1. Qui nous sommes</h2>","<p>Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) is the data controller. Contact <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a>.</p>":"<p>Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) est le responsable du traitement. Contact <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a>.</p>","<h2>2. Data we collect</h2>":"<h2>2. Données que nous collectons</h2>","<li>Account/contact data (forms).</li>":"<li>Données de compte/contact (formulaires).</li>","<li>Transaction data (cards handled by Stripe; we don't store card numbers).</li>":"<li>Données de transaction (cartes gérées par Stripe ; nous ne stockons pas les numéros de carte).</li>","<li>Post-purchase records: buyer email, purchased agent slugs and the Stripe checkout session id (stored to grant your download entitlement), plus any partner/referral code.</li>":"<li>Enregistrements post-achat : e-mail de l'acheteur, slugs des agents achetés et identifiant de session de paiement Stripe (conservés pour vous accorder votre droit de téléchargement), ainsi que tout code partenaire/de parrainage.</li>","<li>Cookieless analytics (Plausible and Vercel Web Analytics / Speed Insights) and error monitoring (Sentry).</li>":"<li>Analytique sans cookie (Plausible et Vercel Web Analytics / Speed Insights) et surveillance des erreurs (Sentry).</li>","<li>Communications and marketing preferences.</li>":"<li>Communications et préférences marketing.</li>","<h2>3. Purposes & legal bases</h2>":"<h2>3. Finalités et bases légales</h2>","<th>Purpose</th>":"<th>Finalité</th>","<th>Basis</th>":"<th>Base</th>","<td>Operate the services</td>":"<td>Exploiter les services</td>","<td>Contract</td>":"<td>Contrat</td>","<td>Payments</td>":"<td>Paiements</td>","<td>Contract / legal obligation</td>":"<td>Contrat / obligation légale</td>","<td>Security & logging</td>":"<td>Sécurité et journalisation</td>","<td>Legitimate interests</td>":"<td>Intérêts légitimes</td>","<td>Analytics</td>":"<td>Analytique</td>","<td>Legitimate interests / consent</td>":"<td>Intérêts légitimes / consentement</td>","<td>Marketing</td>":"<td>Marketing</td>","<td>Consent (opt-in)</td>":"<td>Consentement (opt-in)</td>","<h2>4. Subprocessors</h2>":"<h2>4. Sous-traitants ultérieurs</h2>","<p>Vercel (hosting &amp; web analytics), Stripe (payments), Upstash (entitlement &amp; partner-code storage), Cloudflare R2 (deliverable file storage), Plausible (cookieless analytics), Sentry (error monitoring), Google Fonts (web fonts). Full list on request and in the <a href=\"/trust\">Trust Center</a>.</p>":"<p>Vercel (hébergement &amp; analytique web), Stripe (paiements), Upstash (stockage des droits &amp; des codes partenaires), Cloudflare R2 (stockage des fichiers livrables), Plausible (analytique sans cookie), Sentry (surveillance des erreurs), Google Fonts (polices web). Liste complète sur demande et dans le <a href=\"/trust\">Centre de confiance</a>.</p>","<h2>5. Transfers</h2>":"<h2>5. Transferts</h2>","<p>Outside the EEA we rely on adequacy or Standard Contractual Clauses.</p>":"<p>En dehors de l'EEE, nous nous appuyons sur une décision d'adéquation ou sur les Clauses contractuelles types.</p>","<h2>6. Retention</h2>":"<h2>6. Conservation</h2>","<p>Kept only as long as necessary, then deleted or anonymised.</p>":"<p>Conservées uniquement le temps nécessaire, puis supprimées ou anonymisées.</p>","<h2>7. Your rights</h2>":"<h2>7. Vos droits</h2>","<p>Access, rectify, erase, restrict, port, object, and withdraw consent. You may complain to your supervisory authority (in Czechia, the ÚOOÚ).</p>":"<p>Accès, rectification, effacement, limitation, portabilité, opposition et retrait du consentement. Vous pouvez introduire une réclamation auprès de votre autorité de contrôle (en Tchéquie, l'ÚOOÚ).</p>","<h2>8. Cookies</h2>":"<h2>8. Cookies</h2>","<p>Analytics is cookieless; non-essential tracking loads only with consent.</p>":"<p>L'analytique est sans cookie ; le suivi non essentiel ne se charge qu'avec votre consentement.</p>","<h2>9. Contact</h2>":"<h2>9. Contact</h2>","<p><a href=\"/imprint\">Legal notice / Company details</a></p>":"<p><a href=\"/imprint\">Mentions légales / Coordonnées de l'entreprise</a></p>","<h3>Sales Partner</h3>":"<h3>Partenaire commercial</h3>","<p class=\"pl-desc\">For partners who actively qualify opportunities and participate in progressing the commercial relationship.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-desc\">Pour les partenaires qui qualifient activement les opportunités et participent à la progression de la relation commerciale.</p>","<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Typical activities</span>":"<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Activités typiques</span>","<li>Qualifying customer needs</li>":"<li>Qualifier les besoins des clients</li>","<li>Arranging meetings</li>":"<li>Organiser des rendez-vous</li>","<li>Supporting presentations</li>":"<li>Accompagner les présentations</li>","<li>Maintaining stakeholder engagement</li>":"<li>Entretenir l'engagement des parties prenantes</li>","<li>Assisting with commercial follow-up</li>":"<li>Aider au suivi commercial</li>","<li>Helping move the opportunity toward a decision</li>":"<li>Contribuer à faire avancer l'opportunité vers une décision</li>","<h3>Strategic Partner</h3>":"<h3>Partenaire stratégique</h3>","<p class=\"pl-desc\">For established partners who generate recurring opportunities, provide strategic market access or assume meaningful commercial and customer responsibilities.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-desc\">Pour les partenaires établis qui génèrent des opportunités récurrentes, offrent un accès stratégique au marché ou assument des responsabilités commerciales et clients significatives.</p>","<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Potential activities</span>":"<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Activités potentielles</span>","<li>Recurring pipeline generation</li>":"<li>Génération récurrente de pipeline</li>","<li>Regional or industry market development</li>":"<li>Développement de marché régional ou sectoriel</li>","<li>Active sales ownership</li>":"<li>Prise en charge active des ventes</li>","<li>Account development</li>":"<li>Développement de comptes</li>","<li>Implementation coordination</li>":"<li>Coordination de l'implémentation</li>","<li>Initial customer support</li>":"<li>Support client initial</li>","<li>Joint go-to-market activities</li>":"<li>Activités de go-to-market conjointes</li>","<p class=\"pl-note\">Strategic-partner terms are agreed individually and may depend on volume, territory, responsibilities, support model and commercial commitment.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-note\">Les conditions des partenaires stratégiques sont convenues individuellement et peuvent dépendre du volume, du territoire, des responsabilités, du modèle de support et de l'engagement commercial.</p>","<h3 class=\"pl-lbl\" style=\"margin-top:40px;font-size:11.5px\">Partner contribution and typical commission</h3>":"<h3 class=\"pl-lbl\" style=\"margin-top:40px;font-size:11.5px\">Contribution du partenaire et commission typique</h3>","<th scope=\"col\">Partner contribution</th>":"<th scope=\"col\">Contribution du partenaire</th>","<th scope=\"col\">Typical commission</th>":"<th scope=\"col\">Commission typique</th>","<td>Qualified referral or introduction</td>":"<td>Recommandation ou mise en relation qualifiée</td>","<td>Meeting arrangement and active sales support</td>":"<td>Organisation de rendez-vous et support commercial actif</td>","<td>Full presentation and commercial close</td>":"<td>Présentation complète et conclusion commerciale</td>","<td>Authorized reseller with sales and initial support</td>":"<td>Revendeur agréé avec vente et support initial</td>","<p class=\"pl-small\">Final commission terms depend on the partner's role, transaction size, discount level, customer responsibilities, territory and ongoing support obligations.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-small\">Les conditions finales de commission dépendent du rôle du partenaire, de la taille de la transaction, du niveau de remise, des responsabilités clients, du territoire et des obligations de support continu.</p>","<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Example transaction</span>":"<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Exemple de transaction</span>","<span>Agent contract value</span>":"<span>Valeur du contrat d'agent</span>","<span>Referral Partner commission at 10%</span>":"<span>Commission du partenaire apporteur à 10 %</span>","<span>Revenue retained by ColleagueAI before delivery costs and other expenses</span>":"<span>Revenu conservé par ColleagueAI avant les coûts de livraison et autres dépenses</span>","<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Clear and transparent partner terms</h3>":"<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Des conditions de partenariat claires et transparentes</h3>","<li>Commission is normally calculated from eligible net revenue.</li>":"<li>La commission est normalement calculée sur le revenu net éligible.</li>","<li>Commission becomes payable only after the customer's payment has been received.</li>":"<li>La commission n'est exigible qu'après réception du paiement du client.</li>","<li>Taxes, refunds, credits, chargebacks and excluded pass-through costs may be deducted from the commission base.</li>":"<li>Les taxes, remboursements, avoirs, rétrofacturations et coûts refacturés exclus peuvent être déduits de la base de commission.</li>","<li>Every opportunity must be registered and accepted before commission protection begins.</li>":"<li>Chaque opportunité doit être enregistrée et acceptée avant que la protection de la commission ne commence.</li>","<li>Referral protection applies for a defined contractual period.</li>":"<li>La protection du parrainage s'applique pendant une période contractuelle définie.</li>","<li>Existing customers and previously active opportunities may be excluded.</li>":"<li>Les clients existants et les opportunités précédemment actives peuvent être exclus.</li>","<li>The agreement must define responsibility where multiple partners claim the same opportunity.</li>":"<li>L'accord doit définir la responsabilité lorsque plusieurs partenaires revendiquent la même opportunité.</li>","<li>Renewal and expansion commissions apply only when explicitly included in the partner agreement.</li>":"<li>Les commissions de renouvellement et d'expansion ne s'appliquent que lorsqu'elles sont explicitement prévues dans l'accord de partenariat.</li>","<li>Strategic or reseller relationships may include additional customer-support and service obligations.</li>":"<li>Les relations stratégiques ou de revente peuvent comporter des obligations supplémentaires de support client et de service.</li>","<li>Regional, industry or account exclusivity must be documented in writing.</li>":"<li>Toute exclusivité régionale, sectorielle ou par compte doit être documentée par écrit.</li>","<li>ColleagueAI may reject opportunities that do not meet qualification, compliance or commercial requirements.</li>":"<li>ColleagueAI peut rejeter les opportunités qui ne répondent pas aux exigences de qualification, de conformité ou commerciales.</li>","<p class=\"pl-disc\">Commission percentages shown on this page are indicative program terms and do not create an entitlement to payment. All partnerships are subject to approval and a signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-disc\">Les pourcentages de commission indiqués sur cette page sont des conditions indicatives du programme et ne créent aucun droit à paiement. Tous les partenariats sont soumis à approbation et à la signature d'un accord de partenariat.</p>","<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Apply to become a partner</h3>":"<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Postuler pour devenir partenaire</h3>","<p class=\"pl-formlead\">Tell us about your business and how you would work with ColleagueAI. Include the details below in your email. Applications are reviewed individually; approval and commission eligibility remain subject to a signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-formlead\">Parlez-nous de votre activité et de la manière dont vous travailleriez avec ColleagueAI. Incluez les informations ci-dessous dans votre e-mail. Les candidatures sont examinées individuellement ; l'approbation et l'éligibilité à la commission restent soumises à la signature d'un accord de partenariat.</p>","<li>Your company, website and country</li>":"<li>Votre entreprise, votre site web et votre pays</li>","<li>The partner level you are interested in</li>":"<li>Le niveau de partenariat qui vous intéresse</li>","<li>The industries and customer segments you work with</li>":"<li>Les secteurs et segments de clientèle avec lesquels vous travaillez</li>","<li>Your typical customer reach</li>":"<li>Votre portée client typique</li>","<li>Any existing technology partnerships</li>":"<li>Tout partenariat technologique existant</li>","<span class=\"eyebrow\">Questions</span>":"<span class=\"eyebrow\">Questions</span>","<h2 class=\"sec-h\">Common questions, direct answers.</h2>":"<h2 class=\"sec-h\">Questions fréquentes, réponses directes.</h2>","<p>Attribution is set up when your application is approved. The method, the attribution window and how sales are matched to you are recorded in your signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p>L'attribution est mise en place lorsque votre candidature est approuvée. La méthode, la fenêtre d'attribution et la manière dont les ventes vous sont rattachées sont consignées dans votre accord de partenariat signé.</p>","<p>Commission is held for a review period after each sale, then approved and paid on the schedule set out in your partner agreement. Payment details are confirmed during onboarding.</p>":"<p>La commission est retenue pendant une période de révision après chaque vente, puis approuvée et versée selon le calendrier défini dans votre accord de partenariat. Les modalités de paiement sont confirmées lors de l'onboarding.</p>","<p>Approved partners may refer clients or licence agents themselves and deploy them under their own service agreement. Which routes apply to you is confirmed at approval.</p>":"<p>Les partenaires approuvés peuvent recommander des clients ou concéder eux-mêmes des licences d'agents et les déployer dans le cadre de leur propre contrat de service. Les voies qui s'appliquent à vous sont confirmées lors de l'approbation.</p>","<p>Attribution follows the method agreed in your partner agreement. Sales completed before your partnership was approved cannot be attributed retroactively.</p>":"<p>L'attribution suit la méthode convenue dans votre accord de partenariat. Les ventes conclues avant l'approbation de votre partenariat ne peuvent pas être attribuées rétroactivement.</p>","<p>Rates vary by partner level and are indicative until confirmed. Your applicable rate, and any limits, are fixed in your signed partner agreement and recorded against each sale.</p>":"<p>Les taux varient selon le niveau de partenariat et sont indicatifs jusqu'à confirmation. Votre taux applicable, ainsi que toute limite, sont fixés dans votre accord de partenariat signé et consignés pour chaque vente.</p>","<p>Contact us at hello@colleagueai.ai and we will reissue it. Attribution details are confirmed during onboarding, so your link and commission terms stay tied to your signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p>Contactez-nous à hello@colleagueai.ai et nous le réémettrons. Les détails d'attribution sont confirmés lors de l'onboarding, de sorte que votre lien et vos conditions de commission restent liés à votre accord de partenariat signé.</p>","<p>Yes. Participation requires an approved application and a signed partner agreement. The rate and terms in force at the time of each sale are recorded against it. Request a copy at hello@colleagueai.ai.</p>":"<p>Oui. La participation requiert une candidature approuvée et un accord de partenariat signé. Le taux et les conditions en vigueur au moment de chaque vente y sont consignés. Demandez-en une copie à hello@colleagueai.ai.</p>","<h2>Ready to bring enterprise AI to <em>your</em> clients?</h2>":"<h2>Prêt à apporter l'IA d'entreprise à <em>vos</em> clients ?</h2>","<span class=\"logo-text\" style=\"font-size:18px\">colleague<span class=\"ai\">ai</span>":"<span class=\"logo-text\" style=\"font-size:18px\">colleague<span class=\"ai\">ai</span>","<span class=\"foot-note\">// Partner Pilot Programme · CAI Score™ · Updated June 2026</span>":"<span class=\"foot-note\">// Programme pilote partenaires · CAI Score™ · Mis à jour juin 2026</span>","<h2>What buyers and AI assistants ask about Colleague AI.</h2>":"<h2>Ce que les acheteurs et les assistants IA demandent au sujet de Colleague AI.</h2>","<p>Direct answers on the CAI Score, deployment, EU AI Act alignment, and how the trust layer differs from an agent management platform.</p>":"<p>Des réponses directes sur le CAI Score, le déploiement, l'alignement sur l'EU AI Act et la manière dont la couche de confiance se distingue d'une plateforme de gestion d'agents.</p>","<p>The Portfolio package applies where several specialized agents operate together across functions and systems. Scope typically adds centralized reporting, advanced security and access requirements, shared governance controls, multi-stage approvals and wider organizational rollout. These solutions are designed and priced individually.</p>":"<p>Le package Portfolio s'applique lorsque plusieurs agents spécialisés fonctionnent ensemble à travers les fonctions et les systèmes. Le périmètre ajoute généralement un reporting centralisé, des exigences avancées de sécurité et d'accès, des contrôles de gouvernance partagés, des approbations à plusieurs niveaux et un déploiement organisationnel plus large. Ces solutions sont conçues et tarifées individuellement.</p>","The interactive demo has been withdrawn, so this website sends no messages to an AI provider.":"La démo interactive a été retirée ; ce site web n'envoie donc aucun message à un fournisseur d'IA.","We use privacy-friendly, <strong>cookieless</strong> analytics, no personal tracking or ad cookies. See our ":"Nous utilisons une analyse respectueuse de la vie privée, <strong>sans cookies</strong>, sans suivi personnel ni cookies publicitaires. Voir notre "},"es":{"<p class=\"note\">Last updated: 13 June 2026 · Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) · <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>":"<p class=\"note\">Última actualización: 13 June 2026 · Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) · <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>","<h2>1. Acceptance</h2>":"<h2>1. Aceptación</h2>","<p>By using colleagueai.ai or purchasing any product, subscription, licence or AI agent, you agree to these Terms.</p>":"<p>Al utilizar colleagueai.ai o adquirir cualquier producto, suscripción, licencia o agente de IA, usted acepta estos Términos.</p>","<h2>2. Accounts</h2>":"<h2>2. Cuentas</h2>","<p>You are responsible for accurate details and for safeguarding your credentials and MFA.</p>":"<p>Usted es responsable de la exactitud de los datos y de proteger sus credenciales y su MFA.</p>","<h2>3. Products & licences</h2>":"<h2>3. Productos y licencias</h2>","<li>Subscriptions renew until cancelled.</li>":"<li>Las suscripciones se renuevan hasta su cancelación.</li>","<li>One-time licences follow the <a href=\"/license\">Licence</a>.</li>":"<li>Las licencias de pago único se rigen por la <a href=\"/license\">Licencia</a>.</li>","<li>AI agents are licensed per tenant, deployed in your environment.</li>":"<li>Los agentes de IA se licencian por tenant y se implementan en su entorno.</li>","<h2>4. Payment</h2>":"<h2>4. Pago</h2>","<p>Payments are processed by Stripe in your selected currency, including applicable taxes (e.g. VAT) by billing region.</p>":"<p>Los pagos son procesados por Stripe en la moneda que usted seleccione, incluidos los impuestos aplicables (p. ej. IVA) según la región de facturación.</p>","<h2>5. Acceptable use</h2>":"<h2>5. Uso aceptable</h2>","<p>No security breach attempts, reverse-engineering, resale/redistribution, or unlawful use.</p>":"<p>No se permiten intentos de vulneración de la seguridad, ingeniería inversa, reventa/redistribución ni usos ilícitos.</p>","<h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>":"<h2>6. Propiedad intelectual</h2>","<p>The CAI Score framework, platform and agent blueprints are proprietary to Colleague AI.</p>":"<p>El marco CAI Score, la plataforma y los planos de los agentes son propiedad exclusiva de Colleague AI.</p>","<h2>7. Disclaimers & liability</h2>":"<h2>7. Renuncia de garantías y responsabilidad</h2>","<p>Provided \"as is\"; implied warranties excluded and liability limited to amounts paid in the prior 12 months, to the extent permitted by law. ROI/readiness outputs are indicative, not advice.</p>":"<p>Se ofrece \"tal cual\"; se excluyen las garantías implícitas y la responsabilidad se limita a los importes abonados en los 12 meses anteriores, en la medida en que lo permita la ley. Los resultados de ROI/preparación son orientativos, no constituyen asesoramiento.</p>","<h2>8. Termination</h2>":"<h2>8. Resolución</h2>","<p>Either party may terminate per the order; licence rights then cease.</p>":"<p>Cualquiera de las partes podrá resolver el contrato conforme al pedido; los derechos de licencia cesarán en ese momento.</p>","<h2>9. Governing law</h2>":"<h2>9. Legislación aplicable</h2>","<p>Governed by the laws of Czechia and the EU; courts of Praha, subject to mandatory consumer law.</p>":"<p>Se rige por las leyes de Czechia y de la UE; tribunales de Praha, sin perjuicio de las normas imperativas de protección de los consumidores.</p>","<h2>10. Contact</h2>":"<h2>10. Contacto</h2>","<p><a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>":"<p><a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>","<h2>1. Who we are</h2>":"<h2>1. Quiénes somos</h2>","<p>Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) is the data controller. Contact <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a>.</p>":"<p>Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) es el responsable del tratamiento. Contacto: <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a>.</p>","<h2>2. Data we collect</h2>":"<h2>2. Datos que recopilamos</h2>","<li>Account/contact data (forms).</li>":"<li>Datos de cuenta/contacto (formularios).</li>","<li>Transaction data (cards handled by Stripe; we don't store card numbers).</li>":"<li>Datos de transacción (las tarjetas las gestiona Stripe; no almacenamos números de tarjeta).</li>","<li>Post-purchase records: buyer email, purchased agent slugs and the Stripe checkout session id (stored to grant your download entitlement), plus any partner/referral code.</li>":"<li>Registros posteriores a la compra: correo electrónico del comprador, los slugs de los agentes adquiridos y el id de la sesión de Stripe Checkout (almacenado para concederle su derecho de descarga), además de cualquier código de partner/referido.</li>","<li>Cookieless analytics (Plausible and Vercel Web Analytics / Speed Insights) and error monitoring (Sentry).</li>":"<li>Analítica sin cookies (Plausible y Vercel Web Analytics / Speed Insights) y monitorización de errores (Sentry).</li>","<li>Communications and marketing preferences.</li>":"<li>Comunicaciones y preferencias de marketing.</li>","<h2>3. Purposes & legal bases</h2>":"<h2>3. Fines y bases jurídicas</h2>","<th>Purpose</th>":"<th>Finalidad</th>","<th>Basis</th>":"<th>Base</th>","<td>Operate the services</td>":"<td>Prestar los servicios</td>","<td>Contract</td>":"<td>Contrato</td>","<td>Payments</td>":"<td>Pagos</td>","<td>Contract / legal obligation</td>":"<td>Contrato / obligación legal</td>","<td>Security & logging</td>":"<td>Seguridad y registro</td>","<td>Legitimate interests</td>":"<td>Intereses legítimos</td>","<td>Analytics</td>":"<td>Analítica</td>","<td>Legitimate interests / consent</td>":"<td>Intereses legítimos / consentimiento</td>","<td>Marketing</td>":"<td>Marketing</td>","<td>Consent (opt-in)</td>":"<td>Consentimiento (opt-in)</td>","<h2>4. Subprocessors</h2>":"<h2>4. Subencargados</h2>","<p>Vercel (hosting &amp; web analytics), Stripe (payments), Upstash (entitlement &amp; partner-code storage), Cloudflare R2 (deliverable file storage), Plausible (cookieless analytics), Sentry (error monitoring), Google Fonts (web fonts). Full list on request and in the <a href=\"/trust\">Trust Center</a>.</p>":"<p>Vercel (alojamiento &amp; analítica web), Stripe (pagos), Upstash (almacenamiento de derechos &amp; códigos de partner), Cloudflare R2 (almacenamiento de archivos entregables), Plausible (analítica sin cookies), Sentry (monitorización de errores), Google Fonts (fuentes web). Lista completa disponible a petición y en el <a href=\"/trust\">Centro de Confianza</a>.</p>","<h2>5. Transfers</h2>":"<h2>5. Transferencias</h2>","<p>Outside the EEA we rely on adequacy or Standard Contractual Clauses.</p>":"<p>Fuera del EEE, nos basamos en decisiones de adecuación o en Cláusulas Contractuales Tipo.</p>","<h2>6. Retention</h2>":"<h2>6. Conservación</h2>","<p>Kept only as long as necessary, then deleted or anonymised.</p>":"<p>Se conservan únicamente durante el tiempo necesario y, después, se eliminan o se anonimizan.</p>","<h2>7. Your rights</h2>":"<h2>7. Sus derechos</h2>","<p>Access, rectify, erase, restrict, port, object, and withdraw consent. You may complain to your supervisory authority (in Czechia, the ÚOOÚ).</p>":"<p>Acceder, rectificar, suprimir, limitar, portar, oponerse y retirar el consentimiento. Puede presentar una reclamación ante su autoridad de control (en Czechia, la ÚOOÚ).</p>","<h2>8. Cookies</h2>":"<h2>8. Cookies</h2>","<p>Analytics is cookieless; non-essential tracking loads only with consent.</p>":"<p>La analítica es sin cookies; el seguimiento no esencial se carga únicamente con su consentimiento.</p>","<h2>9. Contact</h2>":"<h2>9. Contacto</h2>","<p><a href=\"/imprint\">Legal notice / Company details</a></p>":"<p><a href=\"/imprint\">Aviso legal / Datos de la empresa</a></p>","<h3>Sales Partner</h3>":"<h3>Partner de Ventas</h3>","<p class=\"pl-desc\">For partners who actively qualify opportunities and participate in progressing the commercial relationship.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-desc\">Para partners que cualifican activamente oportunidades y participan en el avance de la relación comercial.</p>","<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Typical activities</span>":"<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Actividades habituales</span>","<li>Qualifying customer needs</li>":"<li>Cualificar las necesidades del cliente</li>","<li>Arranging meetings</li>":"<li>Concertar reuniones</li>","<li>Supporting presentations</li>":"<li>Apoyar las presentaciones</li>","<li>Maintaining stakeholder engagement</li>":"<li>Mantener la implicación de las partes interesadas</li>","<li>Assisting with commercial follow-up</li>":"<li>Ayudar con el seguimiento comercial</li>","<li>Helping move the opportunity toward a decision</li>":"<li>Ayudar a que la oportunidad avance hacia una decisión</li>","<h3>Strategic Partner</h3>":"<h3>Partner Estratégico</h3>","<p class=\"pl-desc\">For established partners who generate recurring opportunities, provide strategic market access or assume meaningful commercial and customer responsibilities.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-desc\">Para partners consolidados que generan oportunidades recurrentes, proporcionan acceso estratégico al mercado o asumen responsabilidades comerciales y de cliente relevantes.</p>","<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Potential activities</span>":"<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Actividades potenciales</span>","<li>Recurring pipeline generation</li>":"<li>Generación recurrente de pipeline</li>","<li>Regional or industry market development</li>":"<li>Desarrollo de mercado regional o sectorial</li>","<li>Active sales ownership</li>":"<li>Responsabilidad activa sobre las ventas</li>","<li>Account development</li>":"<li>Desarrollo de cuentas</li>","<li>Implementation coordination</li>":"<li>Coordinación de la implementación</li>","<li>Initial customer support</li>":"<li>Soporte inicial al cliente</li>","<li>Joint go-to-market activities</li>":"<li>Actividades conjuntas de go-to-market</li>","<p class=\"pl-note\">Strategic-partner terms are agreed individually and may depend on volume, territory, responsibilities, support model and commercial commitment.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-note\">Las condiciones de los partners estratégicos se acuerdan de forma individual y pueden depender del volumen, el territorio, las responsabilidades, el modelo de soporte y el compromiso comercial.</p>","<h3 class=\"pl-lbl\" style=\"margin-top:40px;font-size:11.5px\">Partner contribution and typical commission</h3>":"<h3 class=\"pl-lbl\" style=\"margin-top:40px;font-size:11.5px\">Contribución del partner y comisión habitual</h3>","<th scope=\"col\">Partner contribution</th>":"<th scope=\"col\">Contribución del partner</th>","<th scope=\"col\">Typical commission</th>":"<th scope=\"col\">Comisión habitual</th>","<td>Qualified referral or introduction</td>":"<td>Referido cualificado o presentación</td>","<td>Meeting arrangement and active sales support</td>":"<td>Concertación de reuniones y soporte activo a las ventas</td>","<td>Full presentation and commercial close</td>":"<td>Presentación completa y cierre comercial</td>","<td>Authorized reseller with sales and initial support</td>":"<td>Revendedor autorizado con ventas y soporte inicial</td>","<p class=\"pl-small\">Final commission terms depend on the partner's role, transaction size, discount level, customer responsibilities, territory and ongoing support obligations.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-small\">Las condiciones finales de la comisión dependen del rol del partner, el tamaño de la transacción, el nivel de descuento, las responsabilidades de cliente, el territorio y las obligaciones de soporte continuo.</p>","<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Example transaction</span>":"<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Transacción de ejemplo</span>","<span>Agent contract value</span>":"<span>Valor del contrato del agente</span>","<span>Referral Partner commission at 10%</span>":"<span>Comisión del Partner de Referidos del 10%</span>","<span>Revenue retained by ColleagueAI before delivery costs and other expenses</span>":"<span>Ingresos retenidos por ColleagueAI antes de los costes de entrega y otros gastos</span>","<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Clear and transparent partner terms</h3>":"<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Condiciones de partner claras y transparentes</h3>","<li>Commission is normally calculated from eligible net revenue.</li>":"<li>Normalmente, la comisión se calcula sobre los ingresos netos elegibles.</li>","<li>Commission becomes payable only after the customer's payment has been received.</li>":"<li>La comisión solo es exigible una vez recibido el pago del cliente.</li>","<li>Taxes, refunds, credits, chargebacks and excluded pass-through costs may be deducted from the commission base.</li>":"<li>De la base de la comisión podrán deducirse impuestos, reembolsos, créditos, contracargos y los costes repercutidos excluidos.</li>","<li>Every opportunity must be registered and accepted before commission protection begins.</li>":"<li>Toda oportunidad debe registrarse y aceptarse antes de que comience la protección de la comisión.</li>","<li>Referral protection applies for a defined contractual period.</li>":"<li>La protección del referido se aplica durante un periodo contractual definido.</li>","<li>Existing customers and previously active opportunities may be excluded.</li>":"<li>Pueden excluirse los clientes existentes y las oportunidades previamente activas.</li>","<li>The agreement must define responsibility where multiple partners claim the same opportunity.</li>":"<li>El acuerdo debe definir la responsabilidad cuando varios partners reclaman la misma oportunidad.</li>","<li>Renewal and expansion commissions apply only when explicitly included in the partner agreement.</li>":"<li>Las comisiones por renovación y ampliación se aplican únicamente cuando se incluyen expresamente en el acuerdo de partner.</li>","<li>Strategic or reseller relationships may include additional customer-support and service obligations.</li>":"<li>Las relaciones estratégicas o de revendedor pueden incluir obligaciones adicionales de soporte al cliente y de servicio.</li>","<li>Regional, industry or account exclusivity must be documented in writing.</li>":"<li>La exclusividad regional, sectorial o por cuenta debe documentarse por escrito.</li>","<li>ColleagueAI may reject opportunities that do not meet qualification, compliance or commercial requirements.</li>":"<li>ColleagueAI puede rechazar oportunidades que no cumplan los requisitos de cualificación, cumplimiento o comerciales.</li>","<p class=\"pl-disc\">Commission percentages shown on this page are indicative program terms and do not create an entitlement to payment. All partnerships are subject to approval and a signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-disc\">Los porcentajes de comisión que se muestran en esta página son condiciones orientativas del programa y no generan ningún derecho de pago. Todas las colaboraciones están sujetas a aprobación y a un acuerdo de partner firmado.</p>","<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Apply to become a partner</h3>":"<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Solicite convertirse en partner</h3>","<p class=\"pl-formlead\">Tell us about your business and how you would work with ColleagueAI. Include the details below in your email. Applications are reviewed individually; approval and commission eligibility remain subject to a signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-formlead\">Cuéntenos sobre su negocio y cómo trabajaría con ColleagueAI. Incluya en su correo electrónico los datos que se indican a continuación. Las solicitudes se revisan de forma individual; la aprobación y la elegibilidad para la comisión siguen estando sujetas a la firma de un acuerdo de partner.</p>","<li>Your company, website and country</li>":"<li>Su empresa, sitio web y país</li>","<li>The partner level you are interested in</li>":"<li>El nivel de partner que le interesa</li>","<li>The industries and customer segments you work with</li>":"<li>Los sectores y segmentos de cliente con los que trabaja</li>","<li>Your typical customer reach</li>":"<li>Su alcance de clientes habitual</li>","<li>Any existing technology partnerships</li>":"<li>Cualquier colaboración tecnológica existente</li>","<span class=\"eyebrow\">Questions</span>":"<span class=\"eyebrow\">Preguntas</span>","<h2 class=\"sec-h\">Common questions, direct answers.</h2>":"<h2 class=\"sec-h\">Preguntas frecuentes, respuestas directas.</h2>","<p>Attribution is set up when your application is approved. The method, the attribution window and how sales are matched to you are recorded in your signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p>La atribución se configura cuando se aprueba su solicitud. El método, la ventana de atribución y la forma en que se le asignan las ventas se recogen en su acuerdo de partner firmado.</p>","<p>Commission is held for a review period after each sale, then approved and paid on the schedule set out in your partner agreement. Payment details are confirmed during onboarding.</p>":"<p>La comisión se retiene durante un periodo de revisión después de cada venta y, a continuación, se aprueba y se paga según el calendario establecido en su acuerdo de partner. Los datos de pago se confirman durante el onboarding.</p>","<p>Approved partners may refer clients or licence agents themselves and deploy them under their own service agreement. Which routes apply to you is confirmed at approval.</p>":"<p>Los partners aprobados pueden recomendar clientes o licenciar ellos mismos los agentes e implementarlos bajo su propio acuerdo de servicio. Las vías que se le aplican se confirman en el momento de la aprobación.</p>","<p>Attribution follows the method agreed in your partner agreement. Sales completed before your partnership was approved cannot be attributed retroactively.</p>":"<p>La atribución sigue el método acordado en su acuerdo de partner. Las ventas completadas antes de que se aprobara su colaboración no pueden atribuirse de forma retroactiva.</p>","<p>Rates vary by partner level and are indicative until confirmed. Your applicable rate, and any limits, are fixed in your signed partner agreement and recorded against each sale.</p>":"<p>Las tarifas varían según el nivel de partner y son orientativas hasta que se confirmen. Su tarifa aplicable, y cualquier límite, se fijan en su acuerdo de partner firmado y se registran para cada venta.</p>","<p>Contact us at hello@colleagueai.ai and we will reissue it. Attribution details are confirmed during onboarding, so your link and commission terms stay tied to your signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p>Escríbanos a hello@colleagueai.ai y se lo volveremos a emitir. Los detalles de atribución se confirman durante el onboarding, de modo que su enlace y sus condiciones de comisión permanecen vinculados a su acuerdo de partner firmado.</p>","<p>Yes. Participation requires an approved application and a signed partner agreement. The rate and terms in force at the time of each sale are recorded against it. Request a copy at hello@colleagueai.ai.</p>":"<p>Sí. La participación requiere una solicitud aprobada y un acuerdo de partner firmado. La tarifa y las condiciones vigentes en el momento de cada venta se registran para esta. Solicite una copia en hello@colleagueai.ai.</p>","<h2>Ready to bring enterprise AI to <em>your</em> clients?</h2>":"<h2>¿Listo para llevar la IA empresarial a <em>sus</em> clientes?</h2>","<span class=\"logo-text\" style=\"font-size:18px\">colleague<span class=\"ai\">ai</span>":"<span class=\"logo-text\" style=\"font-size:18px\">colleague<span class=\"ai\">ai</span>","<span class=\"foot-note\">// Partner Pilot Programme · CAI Score™ · Updated June 2026</span>":"<span class=\"foot-note\">// Programa Piloto de Partners · CAI Score™ · Actualizado June 2026</span>","<h2>What buyers and AI assistants ask about Colleague AI.</h2>":"<h2>Lo que compradores y asistentes de IA preguntan sobre Colleague AI.</h2>","<p>Direct answers on the CAI Score, deployment, EU AI Act alignment, and how the trust layer differs from an agent management platform.</p>":"<p>Respuestas directas sobre el CAI Score, la implementación, la alineación con la EU AI Act y en qué se diferencia la capa de confianza de una plataforma de gestión de agentes.</p>","<p>The Portfolio package applies where several specialized agents operate together across functions and systems. Scope typically adds centralized reporting, advanced security and access requirements, shared governance controls, multi-stage approvals and wider organizational rollout. These solutions are designed and priced individually.</p>":"<p>El paquete Portfolio se aplica cuando varios agentes especializados operan conjuntamente en distintas funciones y sistemas. El alcance suele añadir informes centralizados, requisitos avanzados de seguridad y de acceso, controles de gobernanza compartidos, aprobaciones en varias fases y un despliegue organizativo más amplio. Estas soluciones se diseñan y se tarifican de forma individual.</p>","The interactive demo has been withdrawn, so this website sends no messages to an AI provider.":"La demo interactiva se ha retirado, por lo que este sitio web no envía ningún mensaje a un proveedor de IA.","We use privacy-friendly, <strong>cookieless</strong> analytics, no personal tracking or ad cookies. See our ":"Usamos analítica respetuosa con la privacidad, <strong>sin cookies</strong>, sin seguimiento personal ni cookies publicitarias. Consulte nuestra "},"it":{"<p class=\"note\">Last updated: 13 June 2026 · Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) · <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>":"<p class=\"note\">Ultimo aggiornamento: 13 June 2026 · Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) · <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>","<h2>1. Acceptance</h2>":"<h2>1. Accettazione</h2>","<p>By using colleagueai.ai or purchasing any product, subscription, licence or AI agent, you agree to these Terms.</p>":"<p>Utilizzando colleagueai.ai o acquistando qualsiasi prodotto, abbonamento, licenza o agente AI, l'utente accetta i presenti Termini.</p>","<h2>2. Accounts</h2>":"<h2>2. Account</h2>","<p>You are responsible for accurate details and for safeguarding your credentials and MFA.</p>":"<p>L'utente è responsabile dell'accuratezza dei dati e della protezione delle proprie credenziali e dell'MFA.</p>","<h2>3. Products & licences</h2>":"<h2>3. Prodotti e licenze</h2>","<li>Subscriptions renew until cancelled.</li>":"<li>Gli abbonamenti si rinnovano fino alla disdetta.</li>","<li>One-time licences follow the <a href=\"/license\">Licence</a>.</li>":"<li>Le licenze una tantum sono soggette alla <a href=\"/license\">Licenza</a>.</li>","<li>AI agents are licensed per tenant, deployed in your environment.</li>":"<li>Gli agenti AI sono concessi in licenza per tenant e distribuiti nel proprio ambiente.</li>","<h2>4. Payment</h2>":"<h2>4. Pagamento</h2>","<p>Payments are processed by Stripe in your selected currency, including applicable taxes (e.g. VAT) by billing region.</p>":"<p>I pagamenti sono elaborati da Stripe nella valuta selezionata, comprese le imposte applicabili (ad es. l'IVA) in base all'area di fatturazione.</p>","<h2>5. Acceptable use</h2>":"<h2>5. Uso accettabile</h2>","<p>No security breach attempts, reverse-engineering, resale/redistribution, or unlawful use.</p>":"<p>Sono vietati i tentativi di violazione della sicurezza, il reverse engineering, la rivendita/ridistribuzione o l'uso illecito.</p>","<h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>":"<h2>6. Proprietà intellettuale</h2>","<p>The CAI Score framework, platform and agent blueprints are proprietary to Colleague AI.</p>":"<p>Il framework CAI Score, la piattaforma e i blueprint degli agenti sono di proprietà esclusiva di Colleague AI.</p>","<h2>7. Disclaimers & liability</h2>":"<h2>7. Esclusioni di garanzia e responsabilità</h2>","<p>Provided \"as is\"; implied warranties excluded and liability limited to amounts paid in the prior 12 months, to the extent permitted by law. ROI/readiness outputs are indicative, not advice.</p>":"<p>Fornito \"così com'è\"; le garanzie implicite sono escluse e la responsabilità è limitata agli importi corrisposti nei 12 mesi precedenti, nella misura consentita dalla legge. I risultati relativi a ROI/prontezza sono indicativi e non costituiscono consulenza.</p>","<h2>8. Termination</h2>":"<h2>8. Risoluzione</h2>","<p>Either party may terminate per the order; licence rights then cease.</p>":"<p>Ciascuna parte può recedere secondo quanto previsto dall'ordine; i diritti di licenza cessano di conseguenza.</p>","<h2>9. Governing law</h2>":"<h2>9. Legge applicabile</h2>","<p>Governed by the laws of Czechia and the EU; courts of Praha, subject to mandatory consumer law.</p>":"<p>Regolato dalle leggi della Czechia e dell'UE; foro competente di Praha, fatte salve le norme imperative a tutela dei consumatori.</p>","<h2>10. Contact</h2>":"<h2>10. Contatti</h2>","<p><a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>":"<p><a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>","<h2>1. Who we are</h2>":"<h2>1. Chi siamo</h2>","<p>Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) is the data controller. Contact <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a>.</p>":"<p>Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) è il titolare del trattamento. Contatti <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a>.</p>","<h2>2. Data we collect</h2>":"<h2>2. Dati che raccogliamo</h2>","<li>Account/contact data (forms).</li>":"<li>Dati dell'account/di contatto (moduli).</li>","<li>Transaction data (cards handled by Stripe; we don't store card numbers).</li>":"<li>Dati delle transazioni (le carte sono gestite da Stripe; non conserviamo i numeri delle carte).</li>","<li>Post-purchase records: buyer email, purchased agent slugs and the Stripe checkout session id (stored to grant your download entitlement), plus any partner/referral code.</li>":"<li>Dati successivi all'acquisto: e-mail dell'acquirente, slug degli agenti acquistati e l'id della sessione di checkout Stripe (conservati per concedere il diritto di download), oltre a eventuali codici partner o di segnalazione.</li>","<li>Cookieless analytics (Plausible and Vercel Web Analytics / Speed Insights) and error monitoring (Sentry).</li>":"<li>Analisi senza cookie (Plausible e Vercel Web Analytics / Speed Insights) e monitoraggio degli errori (Sentry).</li>","<li>Communications and marketing preferences.</li>":"<li>Comunicazioni e preferenze di marketing.</li>","<h2>3. Purposes & legal bases</h2>":"<h2>3. Finalità e basi giuridiche</h2>","<th>Purpose</th>":"<th>Finalità</th>","<th>Basis</th>":"<th>Base giuridica</th>","<td>Operate the services</td>":"<td>Erogazione dei servizi</td>","<td>Contract</td>":"<td>Contratto</td>","<td>Payments</td>":"<td>Pagamenti</td>","<td>Contract / legal obligation</td>":"<td>Contratto / obbligo legale</td>","<td>Security & logging</td>":"<td>Sicurezza e logging</td>","<td>Legitimate interests</td>":"<td>Legittimi interessi</td>","<td>Analytics</td>":"<td>Analisi</td>","<td>Legitimate interests / consent</td>":"<td>Legittimi interessi / consenso</td>","<td>Marketing</td>":"<td>Marketing</td>","<td>Consent (opt-in)</td>":"<td>Consenso (opt-in)</td>","<h2>4. Subprocessors</h2>":"<h2>4. Sub-responsabili del trattamento</h2>","<p>Vercel (hosting &amp; web analytics), Stripe (payments), Upstash (entitlement &amp; partner-code storage), Cloudflare R2 (deliverable file storage), Plausible (cookieless analytics), Sentry (error monitoring), Google Fonts (web fonts). Full list on request and in the <a href=\"/trust\">Trust Center</a>.</p>":"<p>Vercel (hosting &amp; analisi web), Stripe (pagamenti), Upstash (archiviazione dei diritti &amp; dei codici partner), Cloudflare R2 (archiviazione dei file consegnabili), Plausible (analisi senza cookie), Sentry (monitoraggio degli errori), Google Fonts (web font). Elenco completo su richiesta e nel <a href=\"/trust\">Trust Center</a>.</p>","<h2>5. Transfers</h2>":"<h2>5. Trasferimenti</h2>","<p>Outside the EEA we rely on adequacy or Standard Contractual Clauses.</p>":"<p>Al di fuori del SEE, ci basiamo su decisioni di adeguatezza o sulle Clausole Contrattuali Standard.</p>","<h2>6. Retention</h2>":"<h2>6. Conservazione</h2>","<p>Kept only as long as necessary, then deleted or anonymised.</p>":"<p>Conservati solo per il tempo necessario, quindi cancellati o anonimizzati.</p>","<h2>7. Your rights</h2>":"<h2>7. Diritti dell'interessato</h2>","<p>Access, rectify, erase, restrict, port, object, and withdraw consent. You may complain to your supervisory authority (in Czechia, the ÚOOÚ).</p>":"<p>Accesso, rettifica, cancellazione, limitazione, portabilità, opposizione e revoca del consenso. L'interessato può presentare reclamo all'autorità di controllo competente (in Czechia, l'ÚOOÚ).</p>","<h2>8. Cookies</h2>":"<h2>8. Cookie</h2>","<p>Analytics is cookieless; non-essential tracking loads only with consent.</p>":"<p>Le analisi sono senza cookie; il tracciamento non essenziale viene caricato solo previo consenso.</p>","<h2>9. Contact</h2>":"<h2>9. Contatti</h2>","<p><a href=\"/imprint\">Legal notice / Company details</a></p>":"<p><a href=\"/imprint\">Note legali / Dati societari</a></p>","<h3>Sales Partner</h3>":"<h3>Partner di Vendita</h3>","<p class=\"pl-desc\">For partners who actively qualify opportunities and participate in progressing the commercial relationship.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-desc\">Per i partner che qualificano attivamente le opportunità e partecipano allo sviluppo della relazione commerciale.</p>","<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Typical activities</span>":"<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Attività tipiche</span>","<li>Qualifying customer needs</li>":"<li>Qualificazione delle esigenze del cliente</li>","<li>Arranging meetings</li>":"<li>Organizzazione di incontri</li>","<li>Supporting presentations</li>":"<li>Supporto alle presentazioni</li>","<li>Maintaining stakeholder engagement</li>":"<li>Mantenimento del coinvolgimento degli stakeholder</li>","<li>Assisting with commercial follow-up</li>":"<li>Assistenza nel follow-up commerciale</li>","<li>Helping move the opportunity toward a decision</li>":"<li>Contributo a far progredire l'opportunità verso una decisione</li>","<h3>Strategic Partner</h3>":"<h3>Partner Strategico</h3>","<p class=\"pl-desc\">For established partners who generate recurring opportunities, provide strategic market access or assume meaningful commercial and customer responsibilities.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-desc\">Per i partner consolidati che generano opportunità ricorrenti, forniscono un accesso strategico al mercato o assumono responsabilità commerciali e verso i clienti di rilievo.</p>","<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Potential activities</span>":"<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Attività potenziali</span>","<li>Recurring pipeline generation</li>":"<li>Generazione ricorrente di pipeline</li>","<li>Regional or industry market development</li>":"<li>Sviluppo del mercato regionale o di settore</li>","<li>Active sales ownership</li>":"<li>Gestione attiva delle vendite</li>","<li>Account development</li>":"<li>Sviluppo degli account</li>","<li>Implementation coordination</li>":"<li>Coordinamento dell'implementazione</li>","<li>Initial customer support</li>":"<li>Supporto iniziale al cliente</li>","<li>Joint go-to-market activities</li>":"<li>Attività congiunte di go-to-market</li>","<p class=\"pl-note\">Strategic-partner terms are agreed individually and may depend on volume, territory, responsibilities, support model and commercial commitment.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-note\">Le condizioni per i partner strategici sono concordate individualmente e possono dipendere dal volume, dal territorio, dalle responsabilità, dal modello di supporto e dall'impegno commerciale.</p>","<h3 class=\"pl-lbl\" style=\"margin-top:40px;font-size:11.5px\">Partner contribution and typical commission</h3>":"<h3 class=\"pl-lbl\" style=\"margin-top:40px;font-size:11.5px\">Contributo del partner e commissione tipica</h3>","<th scope=\"col\">Partner contribution</th>":"<th scope=\"col\">Contributo del partner</th>","<th scope=\"col\">Typical commission</th>":"<th scope=\"col\">Commissione tipica</th>","<td>Qualified referral or introduction</td>":"<td>Segnalazione o presentazione qualificata</td>","<td>Meeting arrangement and active sales support</td>":"<td>Organizzazione di incontri e supporto attivo alle vendite</td>","<td>Full presentation and commercial close</td>":"<td>Presentazione completa e chiusura commerciale</td>","<td>Authorized reseller with sales and initial support</td>":"<td>Rivenditore autorizzato con vendita e supporto iniziale</td>","<p class=\"pl-small\">Final commission terms depend on the partner's role, transaction size, discount level, customer responsibilities, territory and ongoing support obligations.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-small\">Le condizioni finali della commissione dipendono dal ruolo del partner, dall'entità della transazione, dal livello di sconto, dalle responsabilità verso il cliente, dal territorio e dagli obblighi di supporto continuativo.</p>","<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Example transaction</span>":"<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Transazione di esempio</span>","<span>Agent contract value</span>":"<span>Valore del contratto dell'agente</span>","<span>Referral Partner commission at 10%</span>":"<span>Commissione del Partner Segnalatore al 10%</span>","<span>Revenue retained by ColleagueAI before delivery costs and other expenses</span>":"<span>Ricavi trattenuti da ColleagueAI al lordo dei costi di consegna e di altre spese</span>","<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Clear and transparent partner terms</h3>":"<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Condizioni chiare e trasparenti per i partner</h3>","<li>Commission is normally calculated from eligible net revenue.</li>":"<li>La commissione è normalmente calcolata sui ricavi netti ammissibili.</li>","<li>Commission becomes payable only after the customer's payment has been received.</li>":"<li>La commissione diventa esigibile solo dopo che il pagamento del cliente è stato ricevuto.</li>","<li>Taxes, refunds, credits, chargebacks and excluded pass-through costs may be deducted from the commission base.</li>":"<li>Imposte, rimborsi, note di credito, storni e costi pass-through esclusi possono essere detratti dalla base di calcolo della commissione.</li>","<li>Every opportunity must be registered and accepted before commission protection begins.</li>":"<li>Ogni opportunità deve essere registrata e accettata prima che inizi la protezione della commissione.</li>","<li>Referral protection applies for a defined contractual period.</li>":"<li>La protezione della segnalazione si applica per un periodo contrattuale definito.</li>","<li>Existing customers and previously active opportunities may be excluded.</li>":"<li>I clienti esistenti e le opportunità precedentemente attive possono essere esclusi.</li>","<li>The agreement must define responsibility where multiple partners claim the same opportunity.</li>":"<li>L'accordo deve definire le responsabilità qualora più partner rivendichino la stessa opportunità.</li>","<li>Renewal and expansion commissions apply only when explicitly included in the partner agreement.</li>":"<li>Le commissioni su rinnovi ed espansioni si applicano solo se esplicitamente previste nell'accordo di partnership.</li>","<li>Strategic or reseller relationships may include additional customer-support and service obligations.</li>":"<li>Le relazioni strategiche o di rivendita possono comportare ulteriori obblighi di assistenza al cliente e di servizio.</li>","<li>Regional, industry or account exclusivity must be documented in writing.</li>":"<li>L'esclusiva regionale, di settore o per singolo account deve essere documentata per iscritto.</li>","<li>ColleagueAI may reject opportunities that do not meet qualification, compliance or commercial requirements.</li>":"<li>ColleagueAI può rifiutare le opportunità che non soddisfano i requisiti di qualificazione, compliance o commerciali.</li>","<p class=\"pl-disc\">Commission percentages shown on this page are indicative program terms and do not create an entitlement to payment. All partnerships are subject to approval and a signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-disc\">Le percentuali di commissione indicate in questa pagina sono condizioni di programma indicative e non danno diritto ad alcun pagamento. Tutte le partnership sono soggette ad approvazione e alla sottoscrizione di un accordo di partnership.</p>","<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Apply to become a partner</h3>":"<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Candidatevi per diventare partner</h3>","<p class=\"pl-formlead\">Tell us about your business and how you would work with ColleagueAI. Include the details below in your email. Applications are reviewed individually; approval and commission eligibility remain subject to a signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-formlead\">Parlateci della vostra attività e di come lavorereste con ColleagueAI. Includete i dettagli seguenti nella vostra e-mail. Le candidature sono esaminate individualmente; l'approvazione e l'idoneità alla commissione restano subordinate alla sottoscrizione di un accordo di partnership.</p>","<li>Your company, website and country</li>":"<li>La vostra azienda, il sito web e il paese</li>","<li>The partner level you are interested in</li>":"<li>Il livello di partnership a cui siete interessati</li>","<li>The industries and customer segments you work with</li>":"<li>I settori e i segmenti di clientela con cui lavorate</li>","<li>Your typical customer reach</li>":"<li>La vostra copertura tipica di clienti</li>","<li>Any existing technology partnerships</li>":"<li>Eventuali partnership tecnologiche esistenti</li>","<span class=\"eyebrow\">Questions</span>":"<span class=\"eyebrow\">Domande</span>","<h2 class=\"sec-h\">Common questions, direct answers.</h2>":"<h2 class=\"sec-h\">Domande comuni, risposte dirette.</h2>","<p>Attribution is set up when your application is approved. The method, the attribution window and how sales are matched to you are recorded in your signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p>L'attribuzione viene impostata al momento dell'approvazione della vostra candidatura. Il metodo, la finestra di attribuzione e le modalità con cui le vendite vi vengono attribuite sono indicati nel vostro accordo di partnership sottoscritto.</p>","<p>Commission is held for a review period after each sale, then approved and paid on the schedule set out in your partner agreement. Payment details are confirmed during onboarding.</p>":"<p>La commissione viene trattenuta per un periodo di verifica dopo ogni vendita, quindi approvata e pagata secondo le tempistiche stabilite nel vostro accordo di partnership. I dettagli di pagamento vengono confermati durante l'onboarding.</p>","<p>Approved partners may refer clients or licence agents themselves and deploy them under their own service agreement. Which routes apply to you is confirmed at approval.</p>":"<p>I partner approvati possono segnalare clienti oppure ottenere direttamente in licenza gli agenti e distribuirli in base al proprio contratto di servizio. Le modalità applicabili a voi vengono confermate al momento dell'approvazione.</p>","<p>Attribution follows the method agreed in your partner agreement. Sales completed before your partnership was approved cannot be attributed retroactively.</p>":"<p>L'attribuzione segue il metodo concordato nel vostro accordo di partnership. Le vendite concluse prima dell'approvazione della vostra partnership non possono essere attribuite retroattivamente.</p>","<p>Rates vary by partner level and are indicative until confirmed. Your applicable rate, and any limits, are fixed in your signed partner agreement and recorded against each sale.</p>":"<p>Le percentuali variano in base al livello di partnership e sono indicative fino alla conferma. La percentuale applicabile e gli eventuali limiti sono stabiliti nel vostro accordo di partnership sottoscritto e registrati per ogni vendita.</p>","<p>Contact us at hello@colleagueai.ai and we will reissue it. Attribution details are confirmed during onboarding, so your link and commission terms stay tied to your signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p>Contattateci all'indirizzo hello@colleagueai.ai e provvederemo a riemetterlo. I dettagli di attribuzione vengono confermati durante l'onboarding, in modo che il vostro link e le condizioni di commissione restino collegati al vostro accordo di partnership sottoscritto.</p>","<p>Yes. Participation requires an approved application and a signed partner agreement. The rate and terms in force at the time of each sale are recorded against it. Request a copy at hello@colleagueai.ai.</p>":"<p>Sì. La partecipazione richiede una candidatura approvata e un accordo di partnership sottoscritto. La percentuale e le condizioni in vigore al momento di ciascuna vendita vengono registrate per la stessa. Richiedetene una copia all'indirizzo hello@colleagueai.ai.</p>","<h2>Ready to bring enterprise AI to <em>your</em> clients?</h2>":"<h2>Pronti a portare l'AI enterprise ai <em>vostri</em> clienti?</h2>","<span class=\"logo-text\" style=\"font-size:18px\">colleague<span class=\"ai\">ai</span>":"<span class=\"logo-text\" style=\"font-size:18px\">colleague<span class=\"ai\">ai</span>","<span class=\"foot-note\">// Partner Pilot Programme · CAI Score™ · Updated June 2026</span>":"<span class=\"foot-note\">// Partner Pilot Programme · CAI Score™ · Aggiornato June 2026</span>","<h2>What buyers and AI assistants ask about Colleague AI.</h2>":"<h2>Cosa chiedono acquirenti e assistenti AI su Colleague AI.</h2>","<p>Direct answers on the CAI Score, deployment, EU AI Act alignment, and how the trust layer differs from an agent management platform.</p>":"<p>Risposte dirette sul CAI Score, sul deployment, sull'allineamento all'EU AI Act e su come il trust layer si differenzia da una piattaforma di gestione degli agenti.</p>","<p>The Portfolio package applies where several specialized agents operate together across functions and systems. Scope typically adds centralized reporting, advanced security and access requirements, shared governance controls, multi-stage approvals and wider organizational rollout. These solutions are designed and priced individually.</p>":"<p>Il pacchetto Portfolio si applica quando diversi agenti specializzati operano insieme tra funzioni e sistemi. L'ambito include tipicamente reportistica centralizzata, requisiti avanzati di sicurezza e di accesso, controlli di governance condivisi, approvazioni a più fasi e un rollout organizzativo più ampio. Queste soluzioni sono progettate e quotate individualmente.</p>","The interactive demo has been withdrawn, so this website sends no messages to an AI provider.":"La demo interattiva è stata ritirata, pertanto questo sito web non invia alcun messaggio a un provider di AI.","We use privacy-friendly, <strong>cookieless</strong> analytics, no personal tracking or ad cookies. See our ":"Usiamo analisi rispettose della privacy, <strong>senza cookie</strong>, senza tracciamento personale né cookie pubblicitari. Consulta la nostra "},"pl":{"<p class=\"note\">Last updated: 13 June 2026 · Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) · <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>":"<p class=\"note\">Ostatnia aktualizacja: 13 June 2026 · Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) · <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>","<h2>1. Acceptance</h2>":"<h2>1. Akceptacja</h2>","<p>By using colleagueai.ai or purchasing any product, subscription, licence or AI agent, you agree to these Terms.</p>":"<p>Korzystając z colleagueai.ai lub kupując dowolny produkt, subskrypcję, licencję lub agenta AI, akceptujesz niniejsze Warunki.</p>","<h2>2. Accounts</h2>":"<h2>2. Konta</h2>","<p>You are responsible for accurate details and for safeguarding your credentials and MFA.</p>":"<p>Odpowiadasz za prawidłowość danych oraz za ochronę swoich danych uwierzytelniających i MFA.</p>","<h2>3. Products & licences</h2>":"<h2>3. Produkty i licencje</h2>","<li>Subscriptions renew until cancelled.</li>":"<li>Subskrypcje odnawiają się do momentu ich anulowania.</li>","<li>One-time licences follow the <a href=\"/license\">Licence</a>.</li>":"<li>Licencje jednorazowe podlegają <a href=\"/license\">Licencji</a>.</li>","<li>AI agents are licensed per tenant, deployed in your environment.</li>":"<li>Agenci AI są licencjonowani na tenant i wdrażani w Twoim środowisku.</li>","<h2>4. Payment</h2>":"<h2>4. Płatność</h2>","<p>Payments are processed by Stripe in your selected currency, including applicable taxes (e.g. VAT) by billing region.</p>":"<p>Płatności są przetwarzane przez Stripe w wybranej przez Ciebie walucie, z uwzględnieniem obowiązujących podatków (np. VAT) w zależności od regionu rozliczeniowego.</p>","<h2>5. Acceptable use</h2>":"<h2>5. Dopuszczalne korzystanie</h2>","<p>No security breach attempts, reverse-engineering, resale/redistribution, or unlawful use.</p>":"<p>Zakaz prób naruszenia zabezpieczeń, inżynierii wstecznej, odsprzedaży/redystrybucji oraz niezgodnego z prawem korzystania.</p>","<h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>":"<h2>6. Własność intelektualna</h2>","<p>The CAI Score framework, platform and agent blueprints are proprietary to Colleague AI.</p>":"<p>Framework CAI Score, platforma oraz schematy agentów stanowią własność Colleague AI.</p>","<h2>7. Disclaimers & liability</h2>":"<h2>7. Zastrzeżenia i odpowiedzialność</h2>","<p>Provided \"as is\"; implied warranties excluded and liability limited to amounts paid in the prior 12 months, to the extent permitted by law. ROI/readiness outputs are indicative, not advice.</p>":"<p>Usługi świadczone są w stanie „as is” (takim, w jakim się znajdują); gwarancje dorozumiane są wyłączone, a odpowiedzialność ograniczona do kwot zapłaconych w ciągu poprzednich 12 miesięcy, w zakresie dozwolonym przez prawo. Wyniki dotyczące ROI/gotowości mają charakter orientacyjny i nie stanowią porady.</p>","<h2>8. Termination</h2>":"<h2>8. Rozwiązanie</h2>","<p>Either party may terminate per the order; licence rights then cease.</p>":"<p>Każda ze stron może rozwiązać umowę zgodnie z zamówieniem; prawa licencyjne wówczas wygasają.</p>","<h2>9. Governing law</h2>":"<h2>9. Prawo właściwe</h2>","<p>Governed by the laws of Czechia and the EU; courts of Praha, subject to mandatory consumer law.</p>":"<p>Podlega prawu Czech i UE; sądy w Pradze, z zastrzeżeniem bezwzględnie obowiązujących przepisów prawa konsumenckiego.</p>","<h2>10. Contact</h2>":"<h2>10. Kontakt</h2>","<p><a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>":"<p><a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>","<h2>1. Who we are</h2>":"<h2>1. Kim jesteśmy</h2>","<p>Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) is the data controller. Contact <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a>.</p>":"<p>Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) jest administratorem danych. Kontakt: <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a>.</p>","<h2>2. Data we collect</h2>":"<h2>2. Jakie dane zbieramy</h2>","<li>Account/contact data (forms).</li>":"<li>Dane konta/kontaktowe (formularze).</li>","<li>Transaction data (cards handled by Stripe; we don't store card numbers).</li>":"<li>Dane transakcyjne (karty obsługiwane przez Stripe; nie przechowujemy numerów kart).</li>","<li>Post-purchase records: buyer email, purchased agent slugs and the Stripe checkout session id (stored to grant your download entitlement), plus any partner/referral code.</li>":"<li>Dane po zakupie: adres e-mail kupującego, slugi zakupionych agentów oraz identyfikator sesji Checkout w Stripe (przechowywany w celu przyznania uprawnienia do pobrania), a także ewentualny kod partnera/polecającego.</li>","<li>Cookieless analytics (Plausible and Vercel Web Analytics / Speed Insights) and error monitoring (Sentry).</li>":"<li>Analityka bez plików cookie (Plausible oraz Vercel Web Analytics / Speed Insights) i monitorowanie błędów (Sentry).</li>","<li>Communications and marketing preferences.</li>":"<li>Komunikacja i preferencje marketingowe.</li>","<h2>3. Purposes & legal bases</h2>":"<h2>3. Cele i podstawy prawne</h2>","<th>Purpose</th>":"<th>Cel</th>","<th>Basis</th>":"<th>Podstawa</th>","<td>Operate the services</td>":"<td>Świadczenie usług</td>","<td>Contract</td>":"<td>Umowa</td>","<td>Payments</td>":"<td>Płatności</td>","<td>Contract / legal obligation</td>":"<td>Umowa / obowiązek prawny</td>","<td>Security & logging</td>":"<td>Bezpieczeństwo i rejestrowanie zdarzeń</td>","<td>Legitimate interests</td>":"<td>Prawnie uzasadnione interesy</td>","<td>Analytics</td>":"<td>Analityka</td>","<td>Legitimate interests / consent</td>":"<td>Prawnie uzasadnione interesy / zgoda</td>","<td>Marketing</td>":"<td>Marketing</td>","<td>Consent (opt-in)</td>":"<td>Zgoda (opt-in)</td>","<h2>4. Subprocessors</h2>":"<h2>4. Subprocesorzy</h2>","<p>Vercel (hosting &amp; web analytics), Stripe (payments), Upstash (entitlement &amp; partner-code storage), Cloudflare R2 (deliverable file storage), Plausible (cookieless analytics), Sentry (error monitoring), Google Fonts (web fonts). Full list on request and in the <a href=\"/trust\">Trust Center</a>.</p>":"<p>Vercel (hosting &amp; analityka internetowa), Stripe (płatności), Upstash (przechowywanie uprawnień &amp; kodów partnerskich), Cloudflare R2 (przechowywanie plików do pobrania), Plausible (analityka bez plików cookie), Sentry (monitorowanie błędów), Google Fonts (czcionki internetowe). Pełna lista na żądanie oraz w <a href=\"/trust\">Trust Center</a>.</p>","<h2>5. Transfers</h2>":"<h2>5. Przekazywanie danych</h2>","<p>Outside the EEA we rely on adequacy or Standard Contractual Clauses.</p>":"<p>Poza EOG opieramy się na decyzji stwierdzającej odpowiedni stopień ochrony lub na standardowych klauzulach umownych.</p>","<h2>6. Retention</h2>":"<h2>6. Okres przechowywania</h2>","<p>Kept only as long as necessary, then deleted or anonymised.</p>":"<p>Przechowujemy je tylko tak długo, jak to konieczne, a następnie usuwamy lub anonimizujemy.</p>","<h2>7. Your rights</h2>":"<h2>7. Twoje prawa</h2>","<p>Access, rectify, erase, restrict, port, object, and withdraw consent. You may complain to your supervisory authority (in Czechia, the ÚOOÚ).</p>":"<p>Prawo dostępu, sprostowania, usunięcia, ograniczenia przetwarzania, przenoszenia danych, sprzeciwu oraz wycofania zgody. Możesz wnieść skargę do organu nadzorczego (w Czechach – ÚOOÚ).</p>","<h2>8. Cookies</h2>":"<h2>8. Pliki cookie</h2>","<p>Analytics is cookieless; non-essential tracking loads only with consent.</p>":"<p>Analityka nie wykorzystuje plików cookie; śledzenie inne niż niezbędne uruchamiane jest wyłącznie za zgodą.</p>","<h2>9. Contact</h2>":"<h2>9. Kontakt</h2>","<p><a href=\"/imprint\">Legal notice / Company details</a></p>":"<p><a href=\"/imprint\">Nota prawna / Dane firmy</a></p>","<h3>Sales Partner</h3>":"<h3>Partner Sprzedażowy</h3>","<p class=\"pl-desc\">For partners who actively qualify opportunities and participate in progressing the commercial relationship.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-desc\">Dla partnerów, którzy aktywnie kwalifikują szanse sprzedaży i uczestniczą w rozwijaniu relacji handlowej.</p>","<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Typical activities</span>":"<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Typowe działania</span>","<li>Qualifying customer needs</li>":"<li>Kwalifikacja potrzeb klienta</li>","<li>Arranging meetings</li>":"<li>Organizacja spotkań</li>","<li>Supporting presentations</li>":"<li>Wsparcie prezentacji</li>","<li>Maintaining stakeholder engagement</li>":"<li>Utrzymywanie zaangażowania interesariuszy</li>","<li>Assisting with commercial follow-up</li>":"<li>Pomoc w dalszych działaniach handlowych</li>","<li>Helping move the opportunity toward a decision</li>":"<li>Pomoc w doprowadzeniu szansy sprzedaży do decyzji</li>","<h3>Strategic Partner</h3>":"<h3>Partner Strategiczny</h3>","<p class=\"pl-desc\">For established partners who generate recurring opportunities, provide strategic market access or assume meaningful commercial and customer responsibilities.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-desc\">Dla uznanych partnerów, którzy generują powtarzalne szanse sprzedaży, zapewniają strategiczny dostęp do rynku lub przejmują istotne obowiązki handlowe i związane z obsługą klienta.</p>","<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Potential activities</span>":"<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Potencjalne działania</span>","<li>Recurring pipeline generation</li>":"<li>Generowanie powtarzalnego pipeline'u sprzedaży</li>","<li>Regional or industry market development</li>":"<li>Rozwój rynku regionalnego lub branżowego</li>","<li>Active sales ownership</li>":"<li>Aktywne przejęcie odpowiedzialności za sprzedaż</li>","<li>Account development</li>":"<li>Rozwój portfela klientów</li>","<li>Implementation coordination</li>":"<li>Koordynacja wdrożenia</li>","<li>Initial customer support</li>":"<li>Wstępne wsparcie klienta</li>","<li>Joint go-to-market activities</li>":"<li>Wspólne działania go-to-market</li>","<p class=\"pl-note\">Strategic-partner terms are agreed individually and may depend on volume, territory, responsibilities, support model and commercial commitment.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-note\">Warunki dla partnerów strategicznych ustalane są indywidualnie i mogą zależeć od wolumenu, terytorium, zakresu obowiązków, modelu wsparcia oraz zaangażowania handlowego.</p>","<h3 class=\"pl-lbl\" style=\"margin-top:40px;font-size:11.5px\">Partner contribution and typical commission</h3>":"<h3 class=\"pl-lbl\" style=\"margin-top:40px;font-size:11.5px\">Wkład partnera i typowa prowizja</h3>","<th scope=\"col\">Partner contribution</th>":"<th scope=\"col\">Wkład partnera</th>","<th scope=\"col\">Typical commission</th>":"<th scope=\"col\">Typowa prowizja</th>","<td>Qualified referral or introduction</td>":"<td>Kwalifikowane polecenie lub przedstawienie</td>","<td>Meeting arrangement and active sales support</td>":"<td>Organizacja spotkania i aktywne wsparcie sprzedaży</td>","<td>Full presentation and commercial close</td>":"<td>Pełna prezentacja i finalizacja handlowa</td>","<td>Authorized reseller with sales and initial support</td>":"<td>Autoryzowany reseller ze sprzedażą i wstępnym wsparciem</td>","<p class=\"pl-small\">Final commission terms depend on the partner's role, transaction size, discount level, customer responsibilities, territory and ongoing support obligations.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-small\">Ostateczne warunki prowizji zależą od roli partnera, wielkości transakcji, poziomu rabatu, obowiązków wobec klienta, terytorium oraz bieżących zobowiązań w zakresie wsparcia.</p>","<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Example transaction</span>":"<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Przykładowa transakcja</span>","<span>Agent contract value</span>":"<span>Wartość umowy na agenta</span>","<span>Referral Partner commission at 10%</span>":"<span>Prowizja Partnera Polecającego w wysokości 10%</span>","<span>Revenue retained by ColleagueAI before delivery costs and other expenses</span>":"<span>Przychód zatrzymany przez ColleagueAI przed kosztami realizacji i innymi wydatkami</span>","<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Clear and transparent partner terms</h3>":"<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Jasne i przejrzyste warunki partnerskie</h3>","<li>Commission is normally calculated from eligible net revenue.</li>":"<li>Prowizja jest zwykle obliczana od kwalifikującego się przychodu netto.</li>","<li>Commission becomes payable only after the customer's payment has been received.</li>":"<li>Prowizja staje się należna dopiero po otrzymaniu płatności od klienta.</li>","<li>Taxes, refunds, credits, chargebacks and excluded pass-through costs may be deducted from the commission base.</li>":"<li>Podatki, zwroty, uznania, obciążenia zwrotne (chargeback) oraz wyłączone koszty typu pass-through mogą zostać odliczone od podstawy naliczania prowizji.</li>","<li>Every opportunity must be registered and accepted before commission protection begins.</li>":"<li>Każda szansa sprzedaży musi zostać zarejestrowana i zaakceptowana, zanim rozpocznie się ochrona prowizji.</li>","<li>Referral protection applies for a defined contractual period.</li>":"<li>Ochrona polecenia obowiązuje przez określony okres umowny.</li>","<li>Existing customers and previously active opportunities may be excluded.</li>":"<li>Istniejący klienci oraz wcześniej aktywne szanse sprzedaży mogą podlegać wyłączeniu.</li>","<li>The agreement must define responsibility where multiple partners claim the same opportunity.</li>":"<li>Umowa musi określać odpowiedzialność w sytuacji, gdy kilku partnerów zgłasza tę samą szansę sprzedaży.</li>","<li>Renewal and expansion commissions apply only when explicitly included in the partner agreement.</li>":"<li>Prowizje z tytułu odnowień i rozszerzeń obowiązują wyłącznie wtedy, gdy zostały wyraźnie uwzględnione w umowie partnerskiej.</li>","<li>Strategic or reseller relationships may include additional customer-support and service obligations.</li>":"<li>Relacje strategiczne lub resellerskie mogą obejmować dodatkowe obowiązki w zakresie wsparcia i obsługi klienta.</li>","<li>Regional, industry or account exclusivity must be documented in writing.</li>":"<li>Wyłączność regionalna, branżowa lub na klienta musi zostać udokumentowana na piśmie.</li>","<li>ColleagueAI may reject opportunities that do not meet qualification, compliance or commercial requirements.</li>":"<li>ColleagueAI może odrzucić szanse sprzedaży, które nie spełniają wymogów kwalifikacyjnych, compliance lub handlowych.</li>","<p class=\"pl-disc\">Commission percentages shown on this page are indicative program terms and do not create an entitlement to payment. All partnerships are subject to approval and a signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-disc\">Wartości procentowe prowizji przedstawione na tej stronie stanowią orientacyjne warunki programu i nie tworzą uprawnienia do zapłaty. Wszystkie partnerstwa podlegają zatwierdzeniu oraz podpisaniu umowy partnerskiej.</p>","<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Apply to become a partner</h3>":"<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Złóż wniosek, aby zostać partnerem</h3>","<p class=\"pl-formlead\">Tell us about your business and how you would work with ColleagueAI. Include the details below in your email. Applications are reviewed individually; approval and commission eligibility remain subject to a signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-formlead\">Opowiedz nam o swojej firmie i o tym, jak chciałbyś współpracować z ColleagueAI. Zamieść poniższe informacje w swoim e-mailu. Wnioski rozpatrywane są indywidualnie; zatwierdzenie i uprawnienie do prowizji pozostają uzależnione od podpisania umowy partnerskiej.</p>","<li>Your company, website and country</li>":"<li>Twoja firma, strona internetowa i kraj</li>","<li>The partner level you are interested in</li>":"<li>Poziom partnerstwa, którym jesteś zainteresowany</li>","<li>The industries and customer segments you work with</li>":"<li>Branże i segmenty klientów, z którymi pracujesz</li>","<li>Your typical customer reach</li>":"<li>Twój typowy zasięg klientów</li>","<li>Any existing technology partnerships</li>":"<li>Ewentualne istniejące partnerstwa technologiczne</li>","<span class=\"eyebrow\">Questions</span>":"<span class=\"eyebrow\">Pytania</span>","<h2 class=\"sec-h\">Common questions, direct answers.</h2>":"<h2 class=\"sec-h\">Częste pytania, konkretne odpowiedzi.</h2>","<p>Attribution is set up when your application is approved. The method, the attribution window and how sales are matched to you are recorded in your signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p>Atrybucja jest konfigurowana po zatwierdzeniu Twojego wniosku. Metoda, okno atrybucji oraz sposób przypisywania sprzedaży do Ciebie są zapisane w podpisanej umowie partnerskiej.</p>","<p>Commission is held for a review period after each sale, then approved and paid on the schedule set out in your partner agreement. Payment details are confirmed during onboarding.</p>":"<p>Prowizja jest wstrzymywana na okres weryfikacji po każdej sprzedaży, a następnie zatwierdzana i wypłacana zgodnie z harmonogramem określonym w umowie partnerskiej. Szczegóły płatności są potwierdzane podczas onboardingu.</p>","<p>Approved partners may refer clients or licence agents themselves and deploy them under their own service agreement. Which routes apply to you is confirmed at approval.</p>":"<p>Zatwierdzeni partnerzy mogą polecać klientów lub samodzielnie licencjonować agentów i wdrażać ich na podstawie własnej umowy o świadczenie usług. To, które ścieżki mają zastosowanie w Twoim przypadku, jest potwierdzane przy zatwierdzeniu.</p>","<p>Attribution follows the method agreed in your partner agreement. Sales completed before your partnership was approved cannot be attributed retroactively.</p>":"<p>Atrybucja odbywa się zgodnie z metodą uzgodnioną w umowie partnerskiej. Sprzedaż zrealizowana przed zatwierdzeniem partnerstwa nie może zostać przypisana wstecznie.</p>","<p>Rates vary by partner level and are indicative until confirmed. Your applicable rate, and any limits, are fixed in your signed partner agreement and recorded against each sale.</p>":"<p>Stawki różnią się w zależności od poziomu partnerstwa i mają charakter orientacyjny do czasu ich potwierdzenia. Obowiązująca Cię stawka oraz ewentualne limity są ustalone w podpisanej umowie partnerskiej i przypisywane do każdej sprzedaży.</p>","<p>Contact us at hello@colleagueai.ai and we will reissue it. Attribution details are confirmed during onboarding, so your link and commission terms stay tied to your signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p>Skontaktuj się z nami pod adresem hello@colleagueai.ai, a wystawimy go ponownie. Szczegóły atrybucji są potwierdzane podczas onboardingu, dzięki czemu Twój link i warunki prowizji pozostają powiązane z podpisaną umową partnerską.</p>","<p>Yes. Participation requires an approved application and a signed partner agreement. The rate and terms in force at the time of each sale are recorded against it. Request a copy at hello@colleagueai.ai.</p>":"<p>Tak. Uczestnictwo wymaga zatwierdzonego wniosku i podpisanej umowy partnerskiej. Stawka i warunki obowiązujące w momencie każdej sprzedaży są do niej przypisywane. Poproś o kopię pod adresem hello@colleagueai.ai.</p>","<h2>Ready to bring enterprise AI to <em>your</em> clients?</h2>":"<h2>Gotowy, aby dostarczyć AI klasy enterprise <em>swoim</em> klientom?</h2>","<span class=\"logo-text\" style=\"font-size:18px\">colleague<span class=\"ai\">ai</span>":"<span class=\"logo-text\" style=\"font-size:18px\">colleague<span class=\"ai\">ai</span>","<span class=\"foot-note\">// Partner Pilot Programme · CAI Score™ · Updated June 2026</span>":"<span class=\"foot-note\">// Partner Pilot Programme · CAI Score™ · Aktualizacja: June 2026</span>","<h2>What buyers and AI assistants ask about Colleague AI.</h2>":"<h2>O co kupujący i asystenci AI pytają w związku z Colleague AI.</h2>","<p>Direct answers on the CAI Score, deployment, EU AI Act alignment, and how the trust layer differs from an agent management platform.</p>":"<p>Konkretne odpowiedzi na temat CAI Score, wdrożenia, zgodności z EU AI Act oraz tego, czym warstwa zaufania różni się od platformy do zarządzania agentami.</p>","<p>The Portfolio package applies where several specialized agents operate together across functions and systems. Scope typically adds centralized reporting, advanced security and access requirements, shared governance controls, multi-stage approvals and wider organizational rollout. These solutions are designed and priced individually.</p>":"<p>Pakiet Portfolio ma zastosowanie tam, gdzie kilku wyspecjalizowanych agentów działa wspólnie w różnych funkcjach i systemach. Zakres zwykle obejmuje dodatkowo scentralizowane raportowanie, zaawansowane wymagania w zakresie bezpieczeństwa i dostępu, wspólne mechanizmy governance, wieloetapowe zatwierdzenia oraz szersze wdrożenie w organizacji. Rozwiązania te są projektowane i wyceniane indywidualnie.</p>","The interactive demo has been withdrawn, so this website sends no messages to an AI provider.":"Interaktywne demo zostało wycofane, więc ta witryna nie wysyła żadnych wiadomości do dostawcy AI.","We use privacy-friendly, <strong>cookieless</strong> analytics, no personal tracking or ad cookies. See our ":"Używamy przyjaznej prywatności analityki <strong>bez cookies</strong>, bez śledzenia osobowego ani reklamowych plików cookie. Zobacz naszą "},"pt":{"<p class=\"note\">Last updated: 13 June 2026 · Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) · <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>":"<p class=\"note\">Última atualização: 13 de junho de 2026 · Colleague AI (Praha, Chéquia) · <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>","<h2>1. Acceptance</h2>":"<h2>1. Aceitação</h2>","<p>By using colleagueai.ai or purchasing any product, subscription, licence or AI agent, you agree to these Terms.</p>":"<p>Ao utilizar o colleagueai.ai ou ao adquirir qualquer produto, subscrição, licença ou agente de IA, aceita os presentes Termos.</p>","<h2>2. Accounts</h2>":"<h2>2. Contas</h2>","<p>You are responsible for accurate details and for safeguarding your credentials and MFA.</p>":"<p>É responsável pela exatidão dos dados e pela salvaguarda das suas credenciais e do MFA.</p>","<h2>3. Products & licences</h2>":"<h2>3. Produtos & licenças</h2>","<li>Subscriptions renew until cancelled.</li>":"<li>As subscrições renovam-se até serem canceladas.</li>","<li>One-time licences follow the <a href=\"/license\">Licence</a>.</li>":"<li>As licenças de utilização única regem-se pela <a href=\"/license\">Licença</a>.</li>","<li>AI agents are licensed per tenant, deployed in your environment.</li>":"<li>Os agentes de IA são licenciados por tenant e implementados no seu ambiente.</li>","<h2>4. Payment</h2>":"<h2>4. Pagamento</h2>","<p>Payments are processed by Stripe in your selected currency, including applicable taxes (e.g. VAT) by billing region.</p>":"<p>Os pagamentos são processados pela Stripe na moeda selecionada, incluindo os impostos aplicáveis (por exemplo, o IVA) consoante a região de faturação.</p>","<h2>5. Acceptable use</h2>":"<h2>5. Utilização aceitável</h2>","<p>No security breach attempts, reverse-engineering, resale/redistribution, or unlawful use.</p>":"<p>Não são permitidas tentativas de violação da segurança, engenharia inversa, revenda/redistribuição ou utilização ilícita.</p>","<h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>":"<h2>6. Propriedade intelectual</h2>","<p>The CAI Score framework, platform and agent blueprints are proprietary to Colleague AI.</p>":"<p>A estrutura CAI Score, a plataforma e os modelos de agentes são propriedade exclusiva da Colleague AI.</p>","<h2>7. Disclaimers & liability</h2>":"<h2>7. Isenções de garantia & responsabilidade</h2>","<p>Provided \"as is\"; implied warranties excluded and liability limited to amounts paid in the prior 12 months, to the extent permitted by law. ROI/readiness outputs are indicative, not advice.</p>":"<p>Fornecido \"tal como está\"; excluem-se as garantias implícitas e a responsabilidade é limitada aos montantes pagos nos 12 meses anteriores, na medida do permitido por lei. Os resultados de ROI/prontidão são indicativos e não constituem aconselhamento.</p>","<h2>8. Termination</h2>":"<h2>8. Rescisão</h2>","<p>Either party may terminate per the order; licence rights then cease.</p>":"<p>Qualquer das partes pode rescindir nos termos da encomenda; os direitos de licença cessam nesse momento.</p>","<h2>9. Governing law</h2>":"<h2>9. Lei aplicável</h2>","<p>Governed by the laws of Czechia and the EU; courts of Praha, subject to mandatory consumer law.</p>":"<p>Regido pelas leis da Chéquia e da UE; tribunais de Praha, sem prejuízo das normas imperativas de defesa do consumidor.</p>","<h2>10. Contact</h2>":"<h2>10. Contacto</h2>","<p><a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>":"<p><a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a></p>","<h2>1. Who we are</h2>":"<h2>1. Quem somos</h2>","<p>Colleague AI (Praha, Czechia) is the data controller. Contact <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a>.</p>":"<p>A Colleague AI (Praha, Chéquia) é a responsável pelo tratamento dos dados. Contacte <a href=\"mailto:hello@colleagueai.ai\">hello@colleagueai.ai</a>.</p>","<h2>2. Data we collect</h2>":"<h2>2. Dados que recolhemos</h2>","<li>Account/contact data (forms).</li>":"<li>Dados de conta/contacto (formulários).</li>","<li>Transaction data (cards handled by Stripe; we don't store card numbers).</li>":"<li>Dados de transação (cartões processados pela Stripe; não armazenamos números de cartão).</li>","<li>Post-purchase records: buyer email, purchased agent slugs and the Stripe checkout session id (stored to grant your download entitlement), plus any partner/referral code.</li>":"<li>Registos pós-compra: e-mail do comprador, slugs dos agentes adquiridos e o id da sessão de checkout da Stripe (armazenado para conceder o seu direito de transferência), bem como qualquer código de parceiro/referência.</li>","<li>Cookieless analytics (Plausible and Vercel Web Analytics / Speed Insights) and error monitoring (Sentry).</li>":"<li>Análise sem cookies (Plausible e Vercel Web Analytics / Speed Insights) e monitorização de erros (Sentry).</li>","<li>Communications and marketing preferences.</li>":"<li>Preferências de comunicações e de marketing.</li>","<h2>3. Purposes & legal bases</h2>":"<h2>3. Finalidades & bases jurídicas</h2>","<th>Purpose</th>":"<th>Finalidade</th>","<th>Basis</th>":"<th>Base jurídica</th>","<td>Operate the services</td>":"<td>Operar os serviços</td>","<td>Contract</td>":"<td>Contrato</td>","<td>Payments</td>":"<td>Pagamentos</td>","<td>Contract / legal obligation</td>":"<td>Contrato / obrigação legal</td>","<td>Security & logging</td>":"<td>Segurança & registos</td>","<td>Legitimate interests</td>":"<td>Interesses legítimos</td>","<td>Analytics</td>":"<td>Análise</td>","<td>Legitimate interests / consent</td>":"<td>Interesses legítimos / consentimento</td>","<td>Marketing</td>":"<td>Marketing</td>","<td>Consent (opt-in)</td>":"<td>Consentimento (opt-in)</td>","<h2>4. Subprocessors</h2>":"<h2>4. Subcontratantes</h2>","<p>Vercel (hosting &amp; web analytics), Stripe (payments), Upstash (entitlement &amp; partner-code storage), Cloudflare R2 (deliverable file storage), Plausible (cookieless analytics), Sentry (error monitoring), Google Fonts (web fonts). Full list on request and in the <a href=\"/trust\">Trust Center</a>.</p>":"<p>Vercel (alojamento &amp; análise web), Stripe (pagamentos), Upstash (armazenamento de direitos de acesso &amp; de códigos de parceiro), Cloudflare R2 (armazenamento dos ficheiros a entregar), Plausible (análise sem cookies), Sentry (monitorização de erros), Google Fonts (tipos de letra web). Lista completa disponível mediante pedido e no <a href=\"/trust\">Trust Center</a>.</p>","<h2>5. Transfers</h2>":"<h2>5. Transferências</h2>","<p>Outside the EEA we rely on adequacy or Standard Contractual Clauses.</p>":"<p>Fora do EEE, recorremos a uma decisão de adequação ou às Cláusulas Contratuais-Tipo.</p>","<h2>6. Retention</h2>":"<h2>6. Conservação</h2>","<p>Kept only as long as necessary, then deleted or anonymised.</p>":"<p>Conservados apenas durante o tempo necessário e, em seguida, eliminados ou anonimizados.</p>","<h2>7. Your rights</h2>":"<h2>7. Os seus direitos</h2>","<p>Access, rectify, erase, restrict, port, object, and withdraw consent. You may complain to your supervisory authority (in Czechia, the ÚOOÚ).</p>":"<p>Aceder, retificar, apagar, limitar, portar, opor-se e retirar o consentimento. Pode apresentar reclamação à autoridade de controlo competente (na Chéquia, a ÚOOÚ).</p>","<h2>8. Cookies</h2>":"<h2>8. Cookies</h2>","<p>Analytics is cookieless; non-essential tracking loads only with consent.</p>":"<p>A análise é feita sem cookies; o rastreio não essencial só é carregado mediante consentimento.</p>","<h2>9. Contact</h2>":"<h2>9. Contacto</h2>","<p><a href=\"/imprint\">Legal notice / Company details</a></p>":"<p><a href=\"/imprint\">Aviso legal / Dados da empresa</a></p>","<h3>Sales Partner</h3>":"<h3>Parceiro de Vendas</h3>","<p class=\"pl-desc\">For partners who actively qualify opportunities and participate in progressing the commercial relationship.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-desc\">Para parceiros que qualificam ativamente oportunidades e participam no avanço da relação comercial.</p>","<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Typical activities</span>":"<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Atividades típicas</span>","<li>Qualifying customer needs</li>":"<li>Qualificar as necessidades do cliente</li>","<li>Arranging meetings</li>":"<li>Marcar reuniões</li>","<li>Supporting presentations</li>":"<li>Apoiar apresentações</li>","<li>Maintaining stakeholder engagement</li>":"<li>Manter o envolvimento das partes interessadas</li>","<li>Assisting with commercial follow-up</li>":"<li>Apoiar o acompanhamento comercial</li>","<li>Helping move the opportunity toward a decision</li>":"<li>Ajudar a fazer avançar a oportunidade rumo a uma decisão</li>","<h3>Strategic Partner</h3>":"<h3>Parceiro Estratégico</h3>","<p class=\"pl-desc\">For established partners who generate recurring opportunities, provide strategic market access or assume meaningful commercial and customer responsibilities.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-desc\">Para parceiros consolidados que geram oportunidades recorrentes, proporcionam acesso estratégico ao mercado ou assumem responsabilidades comerciais e de relação com o cliente significativas.</p>","<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Potential activities</span>":"<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Atividades potenciais</span>","<li>Recurring pipeline generation</li>":"<li>Geração recorrente de pipeline</li>","<li>Regional or industry market development</li>":"<li>Desenvolvimento de mercado regional ou setorial</li>","<li>Active sales ownership</li>":"<li>Responsabilidade ativa pelas vendas</li>","<li>Account development</li>":"<li>Desenvolvimento de contas</li>","<li>Implementation coordination</li>":"<li>Coordenação da implementação</li>","<li>Initial customer support</li>":"<li>Apoio inicial ao cliente</li>","<li>Joint go-to-market activities</li>":"<li>Atividades conjuntas de go-to-market</li>","<p class=\"pl-note\">Strategic-partner terms are agreed individually and may depend on volume, territory, responsibilities, support model and commercial commitment.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-note\">As condições dos parceiros estratégicos são acordadas individualmente e podem depender do volume, do território, das responsabilidades, do modelo de apoio e do compromisso comercial.</p>","<h3 class=\"pl-lbl\" style=\"margin-top:40px;font-size:11.5px\">Partner contribution and typical commission</h3>":"<h3 class=\"pl-lbl\" style=\"margin-top:40px;font-size:11.5px\">Contribuição do parceiro e comissão típica</h3>","<th scope=\"col\">Partner contribution</th>":"<th scope=\"col\">Contribuição do parceiro</th>","<th scope=\"col\">Typical commission</th>":"<th scope=\"col\">Comissão típica</th>","<td>Qualified referral or introduction</td>":"<td>Referência ou apresentação qualificada</td>","<td>Meeting arrangement and active sales support</td>":"<td>Marcação de reuniões e apoio ativo às vendas</td>","<td>Full presentation and commercial close</td>":"<td>Apresentação completa e fecho comercial</td>","<td>Authorized reseller with sales and initial support</td>":"<td>Revendedor autorizado com vendas e apoio inicial</td>","<p class=\"pl-small\">Final commission terms depend on the partner's role, transaction size, discount level, customer responsibilities, territory and ongoing support obligations.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-small\">As condições finais de comissão dependem da função do parceiro, da dimensão da transação, do nível de desconto, das responsabilidades perante o cliente, do território e das obrigações contínuas de apoio.</p>","<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Example transaction</span>":"<span class=\"pl-lbl\">Exemplo de transação</span>","<span>Agent contract value</span>":"<span>Valor do contrato do agente</span>","<span>Referral Partner commission at 10%</span>":"<span>Comissão do Parceiro de Referência a 10%</span>","<span>Revenue retained by ColleagueAI before delivery costs and other expenses</span>":"<span>Receita retida pela ColleagueAI antes dos custos de entrega e de outras despesas</span>","<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Clear and transparent partner terms</h3>":"<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Condições de parceria claras e transparentes</h3>","<li>Commission is normally calculated from eligible net revenue.</li>":"<li>A comissão é normalmente calculada a partir da receita líquida elegível.</li>","<li>Commission becomes payable only after the customer's payment has been received.</li>":"<li>A comissão só se torna devida após a receção do pagamento do cliente.</li>","<li>Taxes, refunds, credits, chargebacks and excluded pass-through costs may be deducted from the commission base.</li>":"<li>Impostos, reembolsos, créditos, chargebacks e custos repercutidos excluídos podem ser deduzidos à base de cálculo da comissão.</li>","<li>Every opportunity must be registered and accepted before commission protection begins.</li>":"<li>Todas as oportunidades devem ser registadas e aceites antes de ter início a proteção da comissão.</li>","<li>Referral protection applies for a defined contractual period.</li>":"<li>A proteção de referência aplica-se durante um período contratual definido.</li>","<li>Existing customers and previously active opportunities may be excluded.</li>":"<li>Os clientes existentes e as oportunidades anteriormente ativas podem ser excluídos.</li>","<li>The agreement must define responsibility where multiple partners claim the same opportunity.</li>":"<li>O contrato deve definir a responsabilidade quando vários parceiros reivindicam a mesma oportunidade.</li>","<li>Renewal and expansion commissions apply only when explicitly included in the partner agreement.</li>":"<li>As comissões de renovação e de expansão aplicam-se apenas quando expressamente incluídas no contrato de parceria.</li>","<li>Strategic or reseller relationships may include additional customer-support and service obligations.</li>":"<li>As relações estratégicas ou de revenda podem incluir obrigações adicionais de apoio ao cliente e de serviço.</li>","<li>Regional, industry or account exclusivity must be documented in writing.</li>":"<li>A exclusividade regional, setorial ou de conta deve ser documentada por escrito.</li>","<li>ColleagueAI may reject opportunities that do not meet qualification, compliance or commercial requirements.</li>":"<li>A ColleagueAI pode rejeitar oportunidades que não cumpram os requisitos de qualificação, conformidade ou comerciais.</li>","<p class=\"pl-disc\">Commission percentages shown on this page are indicative program terms and do not create an entitlement to payment. All partnerships are subject to approval and a signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-disc\">As percentagens de comissão apresentadas nesta página são condições indicativas do programa e não conferem direito a pagamento. Todas as parcerias estão sujeitas a aprovação e a um contrato de parceria assinado.</p>","<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Apply to become a partner</h3>":"<h3 class=\"sec-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px)\">Candidate-se a parceiro</h3>","<p class=\"pl-formlead\">Tell us about your business and how you would work with ColleagueAI. Include the details below in your email. Applications are reviewed individually; approval and commission eligibility remain subject to a signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p class=\"pl-formlead\">Fale-nos do seu negócio e de como trabalharia com a ColleagueAI. Inclua os dados abaixo no seu e-mail. As candidaturas são analisadas individualmente; a aprovação e a elegibilidade para comissões permanecem sujeitas a um contrato de parceria assinado.</p>","<li>Your company, website and country</li>":"<li>A sua empresa, site e país</li>","<li>The partner level you are interested in</li>":"<li>O nível de parceria que lhe interessa</li>","<li>The industries and customer segments you work with</li>":"<li>Os setores e segmentos de clientes com que trabalha</li>","<li>Your typical customer reach</li>":"<li>O seu alcance típico de clientes</li>","<li>Any existing technology partnerships</li>":"<li>Quaisquer parcerias tecnológicas existentes</li>","<span class=\"eyebrow\">Questions</span>":"<span class=\"eyebrow\">Perguntas</span>","<h2 class=\"sec-h\">Common questions, direct answers.</h2>":"<h2 class=\"sec-h\">Perguntas comuns, respostas diretas.</h2>","<p>Attribution is set up when your application is approved. The method, the attribution window and how sales are matched to you are recorded in your signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p>A atribuição é configurada quando a sua candidatura é aprovada. O método, a janela de atribuição e a forma como as vendas lhe são associadas ficam registados no seu contrato de parceria assinado.</p>","<p>Commission is held for a review period after each sale, then approved and paid on the schedule set out in your partner agreement. Payment details are confirmed during onboarding.</p>":"<p>A comissão é retida durante um período de revisão após cada venda e, em seguida, aprovada e paga de acordo com o calendário definido no seu contrato de parceria. Os dados de pagamento são confirmados durante o onboarding.</p>","<p>Approved partners may refer clients or licence agents themselves and deploy them under their own service agreement. Which routes apply to you is confirmed at approval.</p>":"<p>Os parceiros aprovados podem indicar clientes ou licenciar eles próprios os agentes e implementá-los ao abrigo do seu próprio contrato de prestação de serviços. As vias aplicáveis ao seu caso são confirmadas no momento da aprovação.</p>","<p>Attribution follows the method agreed in your partner agreement. Sales completed before your partnership was approved cannot be attributed retroactively.</p>":"<p>A atribuição segue o método acordado no seu contrato de parceria. As vendas concluídas antes da aprovação da sua parceria não podem ser atribuídas retroativamente.</p>","<p>Rates vary by partner level and are indicative until confirmed. Your applicable rate, and any limits, are fixed in your signed partner agreement and recorded against each sale.</p>":"<p>As taxas variam consoante o nível de parceria e são indicativas até serem confirmadas. A taxa aplicável ao seu caso, bem como quaisquer limites, são fixadas no seu contrato de parceria assinado e registadas em cada venda.</p>","<p>Contact us at hello@colleagueai.ai and we will reissue it. Attribution details are confirmed during onboarding, so your link and commission terms stay tied to your signed partner agreement.</p>":"<p>Contacte-nos através de hello@colleagueai.ai e iremos reemiti-lo. Os detalhes de atribuição são confirmados durante o onboarding, pelo que o seu link e as condições de comissão permanecem associados ao seu contrato de parceria assinado.</p>","<p>Yes. Participation requires an approved application and a signed partner agreement. The rate and terms in force at the time of each sale are recorded against it. Request a copy at hello@colleagueai.ai.</p>":"<p>Sim. A participação exige uma candidatura aprovada e um contrato de parceria assinado. A taxa e as condições em vigor no momento de cada venda ficam registadas na respetiva venda. Solicite uma cópia através de hello@colleagueai.ai.</p>","<h2>Ready to bring enterprise AI to <em>your</em> clients?</h2>":"<h2>Pronto para levar a IA empresarial aos <em>seus</em> clientes?</h2>","<span class=\"logo-text\" style=\"font-size:18px\">colleague<span class=\"ai\">ai</span>":"<span class=\"logo-text\" style=\"font-size:18px\">colleague<span class=\"ai\">ai</span>","<span class=\"foot-note\">// Partner Pilot Programme · CAI Score™ · Updated June 2026</span>":"<span class=\"foot-note\">// Programa Piloto de Parceiros · CAI Score™ · Atualizado em junho de 2026</span>","<h2>What buyers and AI assistants ask about Colleague AI.</h2>":"<h2>O que os compradores e os assistentes de IA perguntam sobre a Colleague AI.</h2>","<p>Direct answers on the CAI Score, deployment, EU AI Act alignment, and how the trust layer differs from an agent management platform.</p>":"<p>Respostas diretas sobre o CAI Score, a implementação, o alinhamento com o EU AI Act e a forma como a camada de confiança difere de uma plataforma de gestão de agentes.</p>","<p>The Portfolio package applies where several specialized agents operate together across functions and systems. Scope typically adds centralized reporting, advanced security and access requirements, shared governance controls, multi-stage approvals and wider organizational rollout. These solutions are designed and priced individually.</p>":"<p>O pacote Portfolio aplica-se quando vários agentes especializados operam em conjunto entre funções e sistemas. O âmbito acrescenta normalmente relatórios centralizados, requisitos avançados de segurança e de acesso, controlos de governança partilhados, aprovações em várias fases e uma implementação organizacional mais alargada. Estas soluções são concebidas e orçamentadas individualmente.</p>","The interactive demo has been withdrawn, so this website sends no messages to an AI provider.":"A demonstração interativa foi retirada, pelo que este site não envia quaisquer mensagens a um fornecedor de IA.","We use privacy-friendly, <strong>cookieless</strong> analytics, no personal tracking or ad cookies. See our ":"Usamos análise respeitadora da privacidade, <strong>sem cookies</strong>, sem rastreio pessoal nem cookies publicitários. Consulte a nossa "}}
